(1063298, 127522, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6, Technical: 4, Appeal: 5, Challenge: 7, Overall Calculated Average Score: 6<br/> <br/>IMO, not enough contrast for B&amp;W, especially with the blur.</td>', 'Composition: 6, Technical: 4, Appeal: 5, Challenge: 7, Overall Calculated Average Score: 6 IMO, not enough contrast for B&W, especially with the blur.', '2004-12-15 02:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063299, 128076, 13749, '<td valign="top">good humor value - especially the fact that the toilet paper is slightly blowing (which may be missed by some people).  a good white balance may have helped here, i''m not sure i like the incandescent tone.</td>', 'good humor value - especially the fact that the toilet paper is slightly blowing (which may be missed by some people).  a good white balance may have helped here, i''m not sure i like the incandescent tone.', '2004-12-15 02:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063301, 127546, 10170, '<td valign="top">Hillarious, very well done indeed. 10</td>', 'Hillarious, very well done indeed. 10', '2004-12-15 02:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063302, 128491, 13749, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  extra sharp at the roots, motion blur at the tips.  great sky, can see some texture in the sand and good balance all around.  not sure if the horizon is slightly tilted or if that''s just a hill.  also, it looks like there may be some sort of figure/house or something right above the grass line on the middle-left.  great though, i like it.</td>', 'beautiful.  extra sharp at the roots, motion blur at the tips.  great sky, can see some texture in the sand and good balance all around.  not sure if the horizon is slightly tilted or if that''s just a hill.  also, it looks like there may be some sort of figure/house or something right above the grass line on the middle-left.  great though, i like it.', '2004-12-15 02:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063303, 127839, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4, Technical: 3, Appeal: 4, Challenge: 6, Overall Calculated Average Score: 4<br/> <br/>Between the darkness and motion blur, no appeal to me.</td>', 'Composition: 4, Technical: 3, Appeal: 4, Challenge: 6, Overall Calculated Average Score: 4 Between the darkness and motion blur, no appeal to me.', '2004-12-15 02:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063306, 128174, 13749, '<td valign="top">haha... hmm, semi-curious as to how this one worked with the feet being the only blurred objects, but very clever</td>', 'haha... hmm, semi-curious as to how this one worked with the feet being the only blurred objects, but very clever', '2004-12-15 02:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063310, 127999, 7151, '<td valign="top">The face is too much of the picture.  For the theme, the hair should dominate more.</td>', 'The face is too much of the picture.  For the theme, the hair should dominate more.', '2004-12-15 02:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063311, 128076, 22479, '<td valign="top">Kudos for creativity. Simple, conveys the point. Overall the photo is rather flat. The textured wall does not add enough interest to captivate the audience. Technically the image has adequate sharpness, focus, and exposure.</td>', 'Kudos for creativity. Simple, conveys the point. Overall the photo is rather flat. The textured wall does not add enough interest to captivate the audience. Technically the image has adequate sharpness, focus, and exposure.', '2004-12-15 02:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063312, 127778, 7151, '<td valign="top">Looks more like she''s just leaning back than there''s really wind going through her hair.  It just ends up looking a little "bride of frankenstein".  And the background''s pretty dull too.</td>', 'Looks more like she''s just leaning back than there''s really wind going through her hair.  It just ends up looking a little "bride of frankenstein".  And the background''s pretty dull too.', '2004-12-15 02:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063313, 128399, 22720, '<td valign="top">cool, first i think flash, but is drawing</td>', 'cool, first i think flash, but is drawing', '2004-12-15 02:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063315, 127052, 22479, '<td valign="top">Oops, did we forget to give this a title? If it was your intention to ''untitle'' this, I think you missed a good oppertunity to give us your perspective on this shot. As it stands, this is a fantastically sharp, well executed and interestingly angled. I think your link with the challenge theme is certainly there, but this image is more about the beauty of the bird, rather than the wind beneath its wings.</td>', 'Oops, did we forget to give this a title? If it was your intention to ''untitle'' this, I think you missed a good oppertunity to give us your perspective on this shot. As it stands, this is a fantastically sharp, well executed and interestingly angled. I think your link with the challenge theme is certainly there, but this image is more about the beauty of the bird, rather than the wind beneath its wings.', '2004-12-15 02:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063316, 128075, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6, Technical: 7, Appeal: 9, Challenge: 7, Overall Calculated Average Score: 7</td>', 'Composition: 6, Technical: 7, Appeal: 9, Challenge: 7, Overall Calculated Average Score: 7', '2004-12-15 02:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063317, 128398, 16301, '<td valign="top">"...as you were, as I want you to be"<br/> <br/>Excellent photo! I really like it, but I don''t like the inner black line ;)<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', '"...as you were, as I want you to be" Excellent photo! I really like it, but I don''t like the inner black line ;) Good luck...', '2004-12-15 02:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063318, 128464, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6, Technical: 7, Appeal: 4, Challenge: 3, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 6, Technical: 7, Appeal: 4, Challenge: 3, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2004-12-15 02:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063319, 128078, 22479, '<td valign="top">Interesting IR like appearance. Not making the connection with the challenge because I imagine you are trying to convey leaves rustling in the cold winter wind. I''m not certain that this image adequately conveys that message. Artistically quite tasteful presentation. Technically, appears to have everything in order. DOF, exposure, focus, detail, tonal range.</td>', 'Interesting IR like appearance. Not making the connection with the challenge because I imagine you are trying to convey leaves rustling in the cold winter wind. I''m not certain that this image adequately conveys that message. Artistically quite tasteful presentation. Technically, appears to have everything in order. DOF, exposure, focus, detail, tonal range.', '2004-12-15 02:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063320, 126957, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4, Technical: 5, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 6, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 4, Technical: 5, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 6, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2004-12-15 02:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063321, 128489, 7151, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''S wind.  :)  Nice capture.  Not sure about the b&amp;w treatment.  The background and sky look a bit flat and washed out.  The kite does stand out well though.</td>', 'Now THAT''S wind.  :)  Nice capture.  Not sure about the b&w treatment.  The background and sky look a bit flat and washed out.  The kite does stand out well though.', '2004-12-15 02:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063322, 127785, 22479, '<td valign="top">Good capture. The artistic presentation and relevance to challenge theme is quite good. Love the skip on the water surface. Gives a sense of speed. Now, technically this is quite adequate. Only suggestion would be to go a little easier on the noise reduction.  There is a subtle but distinct loss of fine detail in the spray and particularly in the distant hills.</td>', 'Good capture. The artistic presentation and relevance to challenge theme is quite good. Love the skip on the water surface. Gives a sense of speed. Now, technically this is quite adequate. Only suggestion would be to go a little easier on the noise reduction.  There is a subtle but distinct loss of fine detail in the spray and particularly in the distant hills.', '2004-12-15 02:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063324, 127053, 16301, '<td valign="top">LOL, man you''re insane! ;)<br/> <br/>Points for making me laugh in "Finals" week :)</td>', 'LOL, man you''re insane! ;) Points for making me laugh in "Finals" week :)', '2004-12-15 02:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063326, 127052, 7151, '<td valign="top">The relatively placid water leads me to believe there maybe wasn''t much wind...?  Pretty nice capture on the bird though.  Too bad its not a little more brightly lit.  Would make it stand out against the darker water better.</td>', 'The relatively placid water leads me to believe there maybe wasn''t much wind...?  Pretty nice capture on the bird though.  Too bad its not a little more brightly lit.  Would make it stand out against the darker water better.', '2004-12-15 02:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063327, 128147, 16301, '<td valign="top">I REALLY like the colors! Nice idea and composition...</td>', 'I REALLY like the colors! Nice idea and composition...', '2004-12-15 02:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063330, 128189, 29777, '<td valign="top">Far out. I like the photo. The title is required to explain the relationship to wind.</td>', 'Far out. I like the photo. The title is required to explain the relationship to wind.', '2004-12-15 02:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063332, 127963, 22479, '<td valign="top">This scores high for originality and creativity. Artistically, I especially like the sharp distinction between the contrast in the flute and the female. Well done and tastefully executed in that regard. I think the lighting on the candles is a bit harsh and there is a distinct blue cast. Doesn''t really detract too much, but I''m just noting that as a possibility for further refinement. One other issue from an artistic standpoint: there is a lot of drip on the table surface which creates some chaos in the overall presentation. I think a quick clean-up could have been in order for more refinement in the artistic aspect. One other suggestion which may, or may not work, is that the table surface could have been covered with a matte or non-reflective cloth which may add further mystery to this dramatic shot.</td>', 'This scores high for originality and creativity. Artistically, I especially like the sharp distinction between the contrast in the flute and the female. Well done and tastefully executed in that regard. I think the lighting on the candles is a bit harsh and there is a distinct blue cast. Doesn''t really detract too much, but I''m just noting that as a possibility for further refinement. One other issue from an artistic standpoint: there is a lot of drip on the table surface which creates some chaos in the overall presentation. I think a quick clean-up could have been in order for more refinement in the artistic aspect. One other suggestion which may, or may not work, is that the table surface could have been covered with a matte or non-reflective cloth which may add further mystery to this dramatic shot.', '2004-12-15 02:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063333, 128293, 29777, '<td valign="top">The image has a motion to it. You can feel the weather moving across the sky. The contrast is a bit much. This looks like a tough shot with the sun right in the frame.</td>', 'The image has a motion to it. You can feel the weather moving across the sky. The contrast is a bit much. This looks like a tough shot with the sun right in the frame.', '2004-12-15 02:30:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1063334, 128410, 7151, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  Though I get the sense that maybe the titled framing is intended to give more feeling of wind than maybe there really was...?  The tone and tecture of the background is excellent, and of course the backlighting is effective.  I''d be interested to see what got cropped on this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  Though I get the sense that maybe the titled framing is intended to give more feeling of wind than maybe there really was...?  The tone and tecture of the background is excellent, and of course the backlighting is effective.  I''d be interested to see what got cropped on this shot.', '2004-12-15 02:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063336, 128464, 7151, '<td valign="top">...is dust in the wind.</td>', '...is dust in the wind.', '2004-12-15 02:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063337, 128076, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 1, Challenge: 3, Overall Calculated Average Score: 4</td>', 'Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 1, Challenge: 3, Overall Calculated Average Score: 4', '2004-12-15 02:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063338, 127556, 29777, '<td valign="top">What is this? I''m having some trouble understanding this image and how it relates to the challenge.</td>', 'What is this? I''m having some trouble understanding this image and how it relates to the challenge.', '2004-12-15 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063340, 128163, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 4, Challenge: 4, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 4, Challenge: 4, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2004-12-15 02:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063341, 128143, 22479, '<td valign="top">Surface tension study? In either event, point well conveyed and appropriate for challenge theme. Lighting improvement: I suggest using a fill flash to better illuminate your subject. It may alter the reflections on the bubbles adversely, or it may actually improve it. In either event, there is strong available back lighting afforded by the sun and thus the exposure on the child''s face suffers.</td>', 'Surface tension study? In either event, point well conveyed and appropriate for challenge theme. Lighting improvement: I suggest using a fill flash to better illuminate your subject. It may alter the reflections on the bubbles adversely, or it may actually improve it. In either event, there is strong available back lighting afforded by the sun and thus the exposure on the child''s face suffers.', '2004-12-15 02:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063342, 128213, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4, Technical: 5, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 4, Overall Calculated Average Score: 4</td>', 'Composition: 4, Technical: 5, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 4, Overall Calculated Average Score: 4', '2004-12-15 02:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063343, 128403, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 2, Challenge: 2, Overall Calculated Average Score: 4</td>', 'Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 2, Challenge: 2, Overall Calculated Average Score: 4', '2004-12-15 02:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063344, 128369, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2004-12-15 02:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063345, 128444, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 5, Technical: 5, Appeal: 3, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2004-12-15 02:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063347, 128425, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like the thinking here. The shallow depth of field doesn''t help add to the illusion that the car is not a model. I think it would have been more convincing if the front of the car were in focus and the windshild wipers and seats were out of focus.</td>', 'I like the thinking here. The shallow depth of field doesn''t help add to the illusion that the car is not a model. I think it would have been more convincing if the front of the car were in focus and the windshild wipers and seats were out of focus.', '2004-12-15 02:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063348, 128305, 22479, '<td valign="top">Odd post processing. The foreground female appears to be pasted onto the backdrop, which I suspect is a result of aggressive sharpening, The size of the entry is rather small and if you had utilized the maximum 640 pixel allowance, better detail would be seen in the female''s eyes and facial features. The backdrop can use a slight boost in contrast to make the night sky really dark. This would improve the posterization effect evident in the girl''s hair/hat. Overall there is nothing glaringly deficit, and I wish you luck in this and future submissions.</td>', 'Odd post processing. The foreground female appears to be pasted onto the backdrop, which I suspect is a result of aggressive sharpening, The size of the entry is rather small and if you had utilized the maximum 640 pixel allowance, better detail would be seen in the female''s eyes and facial features. The backdrop can use a slight boost in contrast to make the night sky really dark. This would improve the posterization effect evident in the girl''s hair/hat. Overall there is nothing glaringly deficit, and I wish you luck in this and future submissions.', '2004-12-15 02:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063350, 128414, 29777, '<td valign="top">The washed out look gives the idea of a sketch of a tree in the breexe.</td>', 'The washed out look gives the idea of a sketch of a tree in the breexe.', '2004-12-15 02:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063351, 128451, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5, Technical: 6, Appeal: 5, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5</td>', 'Composition: 5, Technical: 6, Appeal: 5, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5', '2004-12-15 02:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063352, 128338, 23458, '<td valign="top">This image has so much potential - but there are a few issues - firstly its slightly overexposed at the top - I find this really distracting.  Secondly - you should have made it larger - its hard to see the details and properly evaluate. I would definately go back and reshoot here if I were you, it''s a terrific scene.</td>', 'This image has so much potential - but there are a few issues - firstly its slightly overexposed at the top - I find this really distracting.  Secondly - you should have made it larger - its hard to see the details and properly evaluate. I would definately go back and reshoot here if I were you, it''s a terrific scene.', '2004-12-15 02:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063353, 128244, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8, Technical: 8, Appeal: 8, Challenge: 8, Overall Calculated Average Score: 8</td>', 'Composition: 8, Technical: 8, Appeal: 8, Challenge: 8, Overall Calculated Average Score: 8', '2004-12-15 02:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
