(1063422, 127786, 22479, '<td valign="top">...Not quite. She is pleasant on the eyes, however. Lighting is rather harsh and there is a stair-step artifact introduced with overzealous edge sharpening.</td>', '...Not quite. She is pleasant on the eyes, however. Lighting is rather harsh and there is a stair-step artifact introduced with overzealous edge sharpening.', '2004-12-15 03:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
