(1063425, 127053, 22479, '<td valign="top">Quite comical. His pose, disposition, and intensity is rediculously amusing. Excellent piece of photography! Love the sky, and the stop motion.</td>', 'Quite comical. His pose, disposition, and intensity is rediculously amusing. Excellent piece of photography! Love the sky, and the stop motion.', '2004-12-15 03:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
