(1063432, 127472, 29486, '<td valign="top">Looks like trees to me. No conveyance of wind itself. None of them are leaning. Nice picture otherwise.</td>', 'Looks like trees to me. No conveyance of wind itself. None of them are leaning. Nice picture otherwise.', '2004-12-15 03:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063433, 127849, 22479, '<td valign="top">Suggestion: use bicubic resizing. Several programs can do this. Resizing artifacts are too predominant.</td>', 'Suggestion: use bicubic resizing. Several programs can do this. Resizing artifacts are too predominant.', '2004-12-15 03:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063435, 127344, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too much cloud, not enough anything else, especially since the cloud is a really dirty yellow and not very attractive.</td>', 'Too much cloud, not enough anything else, especially since the cloud is a really dirty yellow and not very attractive.', '2004-12-15 03:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063436, 128189, 29486, '<td valign="top">The angle is horrible. You can barely see the car is in two pieces. The Bldg in the back does nothing to enhance the picture. I assume by the title that it crashed because of wind??</td>', 'The angle is horrible. You can barely see the car is in two pieces. The Bldg in the back does nothing to enhance the picture. I assume by the title that it crashed because of wind??', '2004-12-15 03:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063437, 127930, 22479, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition. Fits the challenge theme excellently.<br/> <br/>Technical aspects a little weak, unfortunately since there is a significant amount of flare and noise.  The overall detail seems to be a little soft. Still, if I squint my eyes and view from afar, I am breathtaken by this vantage. Well done on artistic merits.</td>', 'I really like the composition. Fits the challenge theme excellently. Technical aspects a little weak, unfortunately since there is a significant amount of flare and noise.  The overall detail seems to be a little soft. Still, if I squint my eyes and view from afar, I am breathtaken by this vantage. Well done on artistic merits.', '2004-12-15 03:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063440, 126905, 29486, '<td valign="top">The relationship to wind? The image looks overall dull. Dull green water surrounded by dull rock. Needs something to make it shine.</td>', 'The relationship to wind? The image looks overall dull. Dull green water surrounded by dull rock. Needs something to make it shine.', '2004-12-15 03:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063447, 128131, 29486, '<td valign="top">I''m not buying it.</td>', 'I''m not buying it.', '2004-12-15 03:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063448, 128388, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too much conflict with the background</td>', 'Too much conflict with the background', '2004-12-15 03:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063450, 128370, 17877, '<td valign="top">Although I don''t think this picture exactly captures the concept of "wind", it is quite a spectacular setting and I am quite jealous that you had the opportunity to take this shot. I am just wondering, where did you take the picture from, a boat or an elevated place on another island?</td>', 'Although I don''t think this picture exactly captures the concept of "wind", it is quite a spectacular setting and I am quite jealous that you had the opportunity to take this shot. I am just wondering, where did you take the picture from, a boat or an elevated place on another island?', '2004-12-15 03:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063455, 127680, 29486, '<td valign="top">Too fuzzy. It''s not pleasing.</td>', 'Too fuzzy. It''s not pleasing.', '2004-12-15 03:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063456, 128147, 13749, '<td valign="top">i don''t usually like artificial appearances such as this, but this one catches my eye in an attractive way - perhaps because of the unique and dynamic angle, as well as the subdued hues (as opposed to the bright, overbearing saturation that often accompanies tweaked images)</td>', 'i don''t usually like artificial appearances such as this, but this one catches my eye in an attractive way - perhaps because of the unique and dynamic angle, as well as the subdued hues (as opposed to the bright, overbearing saturation that often accompanies tweaked images)', '2004-12-15 03:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063457, 128447, 29486, '<td valign="top">Not real interesting</td>', 'Not real interesting', '2004-12-15 03:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063458, 127867, 13749, '<td valign="top">simplistic, but good.  if there were 2 windmills, i wouldn''t like it nearly as much (although 10+ might be good too).  aside from the basic editing rules, you might want to edit out that pole in the foreground as well as all the structures in the background.. might make for a very interesting image.</td>', 'simplistic, but good.  if there were 2 windmills, i wouldn''t like it nearly as much (although 10+ might be good too).  aside from the basic editing rules, you might want to edit out that pole in the foreground as well as all the structures in the background.. might make for a very interesting image.', '2004-12-15 03:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063459, 127468, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject and would look even better isolated against a solid color background. Nice job!</td>', 'This is a great subject and would look even better isolated against a solid color background. Nice job!', '2004-12-15 03:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063460, 128176, 29486, '<td valign="top">Lackluster</td>', 'Lackluster', '2004-12-15 03:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063461, 127967, 29486, '<td valign="top">Boring</td>', 'Boring', '2004-12-15 03:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063462, 128463, 13749, '<td valign="top">wow.  at first i thought that those were some crazy looking trees.. guess they''re just weeds/plants of some sort.  nice perspective and colors (maybe a tad more yellow in the weeds? who knows)</td>', 'wow.  at first i thought that those were some crazy looking trees.. guess they''re just weeds/plants of some sort.  nice perspective and colors (maybe a tad more yellow in the weeds? who knows)', '2004-12-15 03:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063463, 128370, 13749, '<td valign="top">wow.  and here i am sitting in my apartment.  how sad.  ;)<br/> <br/>i love the human element in this photo - without it, would just be another attractive landscape/seascape shot.  with it, adds a human/personal touch and makes it much more interesting.</td>', 'wow.  and here i am sitting in my apartment.  how sad.  ;) i love the human element in this photo - without it, would just be another attractive landscape/seascape shot.  with it, adds a human/personal touch and makes it much more interesting.', '2004-12-15 03:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063464, 127003, 29486, '<td valign="top">If it were actually a windy day then this would have been a great photo but all the people just mulling around in the background not suffering the same effect really hurt this one.  Maybe he''s walking into a wind tunnel? Either this is setup or there is more than meets the eye on this one.</td>', 'If it were actually a windy day then this would have been a great photo but all the people just mulling around in the background not suffering the same effect really hurt this one.  Maybe he''s walking into a wind tunnel? Either this is setup or there is more than meets the eye on this one.', '2004-12-15 03:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063465, 128490, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nothing interesting about this.</td>', 'Nothing interesting about this.', '2004-12-15 03:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063466, 127911, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot. The white on his nose is a little hot, but you did a great job with the setup and composition.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot. The white on his nose is a little hot, but you did a great job with the setup and composition.', '2004-12-15 03:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063469, 128075, 13749, '<td valign="top">while the motion blur does help convey the notion of wind, i feel that the sharpness at the center of the feather detracts slightly because it brings our focus into the center of the feather and away from the elements around it.  in addition, the slight corner of gray in the upper right somewhat detracts from the otherwise pleasing and gentle white background.</td>', 'while the motion blur does help convey the notion of wind, i feel that the sharpness at the center of the feather detracts slightly because it brings our focus into the center of the feather and away from the elements around it.  in addition, the slight corner of gray in the upper right somewhat detracts from the otherwise pleasing and gentle white background.', '2004-12-15 03:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063470, 128425, 29486, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2004-12-15 03:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1063471, 128429, 13749, '<td valign="top">slightly improved color rendition could help this image greatly, as well as a possible slight move to disclude the brances on the left.</td>', 'slightly improved color rendition could help this image greatly, as well as a possible slight move to disclude the brances on the left.', '2004-12-15 03:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
