(1063484, 128416, 13749, '<td valign="top">may have preferred a slightly different angle (not sure why - perhaps would like more of a view of the last one?).  texture and color is great, especially in the foreground.</td>', 'may have preferred a slightly different angle (not sure why - perhaps would like more of a view of the last one?).  texture and color is great, especially in the foreground.', '2004-12-15 04:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
