(1064207, 128421, 26827, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6, Technical: 6, Appeal: 4, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5<br/> <br/>The issue I had with this meeting the challenge, and it is by no means an issue with ust this phot, is showing just effects of wind, without really showing "Wind"  It could just be that they were put up very badly and santa had too much to drink (:P).  Had your composition not included the water, but some of the sky and showed branches being blown or something just to show not only the funny thing that wind did, but also that it was still there.  Looking back, I did up the challenge score to "5"</td>', 'Composition: 6, Technical: 6, Appeal: 4, Challenge: 5, Overall Calculated Average Score: 5 The issue I had with this meeting the challenge, and it is by no means an issue with ust this phot, is showing just effects of wind, without really showing "Wind"  It could just be that they were put up very badly and santa had too much to drink (:P).  Had your composition not included the water, but some of the sky and showed branches being blown or something just to show not only the funny thing that wind did, but also that it was still there.  Looking back, I did up the challenge score to "5"', '2004-12-15 13:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
