(1064300, 128037, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of the shot and the fact that it seems so vast. It has good color and sharpness. It''s unusual enough to be interesting and hold attention. If I was going to nitpick anything it would be the slightly brown cloud on the left being a slight distraction, possibly because it stands out as different from the rest of the clouds. I''m also not sure I would instantly think wind just by looking at this image but I''m not saying that it doesnt represent it in some way.</td>', 'I like the perspective of the shot and the fact that it seems so vast. It has good color and sharpness. It''s unusual enough to be interesting and hold attention. If I was going to nitpick anything it would be the slightly brown cloud on the left being a slight distraction, possibly because it stands out as different from the rest of the clouds. I''m also not sure I would instantly think wind just by looking at this image but I''m not saying that it doesnt represent it in some way.', '2004-12-15 14:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
