(1064398, 127963, 27524, '<td valign="top">Interesting... i would used different picture type... greenish color of her face is not nice.</td>', 'Interesting... i would used different picture type... greenish color of her face is not nice.', '2004-12-15 15:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064400, 127510, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) Beautiful colors... light waves in front and dark at back.</td>', ':) Beautiful colors... light waves in front and dark at back.', '2004-12-15 15:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064403, 128410, 22479, '<td valign="top">Bold entry, I congratulate you on your innovative style. I fear DPC will vote you down somewhat. A shame, I say. Excellent backlighting, detail, sharpness, and clarity. Frame and composition is much to my liking. Stands easily on its artistic and technical merits. Ever so slight haloing around the stem which does not significantly detract from the beauty of this stunning photo.</td>', 'Bold entry, I congratulate you on your innovative style. I fear DPC will vote you down somewhat. A shame, I say. Excellent backlighting, detail, sharpness, and clarity. Frame and composition is much to my liking. Stands easily on its artistic and technical merits. Ever so slight haloing around the stem which does not significantly detract from the beauty of this stunning photo.', '2004-12-15 15:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064421, 128461, 27524, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of movement...</td>', 'Beautiful capture of movement...', '2004-12-15 15:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064425, 128215, 22479, '<td valign="top">I''d like to add a comment which you may find useful. I think you have quite an interesting entry. There are a few details which detract from this image, however. First, there is a lot of blue fringing created by an inferior lens on what I suspect to be a consumer digicam that can''t quite deliver crisp, clean photos. Ultimately, this is somewhat beyond your control, and I will not be too harsh for this reason. Along the same lines, there is an obvious lack of fine detail in the leaves, lines, branches, and wooden bird. Again this is probably somewhat of a limitation of your camera. I think there''s some post processing effects as well, and as you grow more confident in your skills, your images should blossom. I''m learning too, it''s a fun, and fascinating hobby. :)</td>', 'I''d like to add a comment which you may find useful. I think you have quite an interesting entry. There are a few details which detract from this image, however. First, there is a lot of blue fringing created by an inferior lens on what I suspect to be a consumer digicam that can''t quite deliver crisp, clean photos. Ultimately, this is somewhat beyond your control, and I will not be too harsh for this reason. Along the same lines, there is an obvious lack of fine detail in the leaves, lines, branches, and wooden bird. Again this is probably somewhat of a limitation of your camera. I think there''s some post processing effects as well, and as you grow more confident in your skills, your images should blossom. I''m learning too, it''s a fun, and fascinating hobby. :)', '2004-12-15 15:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064426, 128452, 25735, '<td valign="top">i think this is not subject to the challenge but really its very good photo</td>', 'i think this is not subject to the challenge but really its very good photo', '2004-12-15 15:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064428, 128454, 25735, '<td valign="top">this is not subject to the challenge. but really very good photo</td>', 'this is not subject to the challenge. but really very good photo', '2004-12-15 15:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064432, 127763, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ah, this is a beautiful capture. I think the smaller windmill is a nice counterpoint to the foreground. Person on the steps is unfortunately distracting. Same with the metal housing/cabinet in the lower left edge.  I feel that you could have improved the color saturation by selectively boosting the cyans/blues, and greens. A dehazing step with an unsharp mask could also liven up the picture somewhat. Overall a pleasing entry.</td>', 'Ah, this is a beautiful capture. I think the smaller windmill is a nice counterpoint to the foreground. Person on the steps is unfortunately distracting. Same with the metal housing/cabinet in the lower left edge.  I feel that you could have improved the color saturation by selectively boosting the cyans/blues, and greens. A dehazing step with an unsharp mask could also liven up the picture somewhat. Overall a pleasing entry.', '2004-12-15 15:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064451, 128435, 26030, '<td valign="top">good shoot<br/>natural colours , rapid reflex on taking shot<br/>     0verall it take        7</td>', 'good shootnatural colours , rapid reflex on taking shot     0verall it take        7', '2004-12-15 15:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064452, 128464, 27524, '<td valign="top">Creative concept... good work.</td>', 'Creative concept... good work.', '2004-12-15 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064453, 127766, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture and choice for this difficult challenge. I only wish for livelier colors of the sea and the sky/stronger blue would lighten up the photo. 7.</td>', 'Very nice capture and choice for this difficult challenge. I only wish for livelier colors of the sea and the sky/stronger blue would lighten up the photo. 7.', '2004-12-15 15:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064454, 128461, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like all the motion in this shot.</td>', 'I like all the motion in this shot.', '2004-12-15 15:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064455, 128431, 26030, '<td valign="top">fuuny picture, but still alittle bit darky, i cannot understand its issue<br/> yet it take 5</td>', 'fuuny picture, but still alittle bit darky, i cannot understand its issue yet it take 5', '2004-12-15 15:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
