(1064460, 127797, 26364, '<td valign="top">would be better if it followed the 1/3 rule, and have the candle on the right 1/3, so the smoke could drift to the left</td>', 'would be better if it followed the 1/3 rule, and have the candle on the right 1/3, so the smoke could drift to the left', '2004-12-15 15:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064464, 127797, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I especially like the smoke trailing down the left of the candle. I wonder how many times you lit it and blew it out before you got a shot you liked . . . :)</td>', 'Nice picture. I especially like the smoke trailing down the left of the candle. I wonder how many times you lit it and blew it out before you got a shot you liked . . . :)', '2004-12-15 15:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064465, 128213, 29269, '<td valign="top">The blurry image does not seem to convey the wind - and is not the most pleasant thing to look at. Unfortunately, cannot recommend the improvement except perhaps shorter exp. time that would have yielded less blurry image, yet leave teh indication of imbalance caused by the wind. 3.</td>', 'The blurry image does not seem to convey the wind - and is not the most pleasant thing to look at. Unfortunately, cannot recommend the improvement except perhaps shorter exp. time that would have yielded less blurry image, yet leave teh indication of imbalance caused by the wind. 3.', '2004-12-15 15:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064466, 128493, 17507, '<td valign="top">I normally think dogs look dumb, but this one looks genuinely happy, and the expression has a profundity rare in the canine world!</td>', 'I normally think dogs look dumb, but this one looks genuinely happy, and the expression has a profundity rare in the canine world!', '2004-12-15 15:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064468, 128173, 22479, '<td valign="top">Too much post processing on this one. Gives the image a rather unappealing undetailed, plastered apearance. This image fits the challenge theme well however. It''s just crippled by technical issues.</td>', 'Too much post processing on this one. Gives the image a rather unappealing undetailed, plastered apearance. This image fits the challenge theme well however. It''s just crippled by technical issues.', '2004-12-15 15:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064472, 127003, 24784, '<td valign="top">this is a fake - too easy to see  -  sorry</td>', 'this is a fake - too easy to see  -  sorry', '2004-12-15 15:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064473, 127565, 17507, '<td valign="top">Ah, I was hoping to see some interpretations other than just "gusts of air..."<br/>I like his hat.</td>', 'Ah, I was hoping to see some interpretations other than just "gusts of air..."I like his hat.', '2004-12-15 15:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064475, 128432, 22479, '<td valign="top">The biggest fault in this picture is the submission size. There is no reason to submit anything smaller than 600 pixels on the long edge. Otherwise, I think the smoke contrasts nicely with the silhouette and this is appropriate for the challenge theme.</td>', 'The biggest fault in this picture is the submission size. There is no reason to submit anything smaller than 600 pixels on the long edge. Otherwise, I think the smoke contrasts nicely with the silhouette and this is appropriate for the challenge theme.', '2004-12-15 15:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064476, 127911, 29269, '<td valign="top">I think, since you put the sunglasses on the dog, and you wanted to picture the wind blowing, a better choice might have been a real scarf. Scarfs are usually worn in cold, windy weather, and that would improve the image in my eyes. 4.</td>', 'I think, since you put the sunglasses on the dog, and you wanted to picture the wind blowing, a better choice might have been a real scarf. Scarfs are usually worn in cold, windy weather, and that would improve the image in my eyes. 4.', '2004-12-15 15:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064479, 127665, 22479, '<td valign="top">This one appears to look overprocessed evident by the strong halos and lack of fine details arond the waves.</td>', 'This one appears to look overprocessed evident by the strong halos and lack of fine details arond the waves.', '2004-12-15 15:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064480, 128147, 17507, '<td valign="top">this picture is delightfully weird. Was the color retouched at all? The yellow sky sure is something. I would like this picture much more if the subject stood out from the background more - the trees are too contrasty and draw the eye away from the hanging girl. I guess there might not have been much you could do about it, except hope for overcast weather . . . but maybe if you''re going to work on this photo further, beyond the scope of DPC, you can do some levels adjustments and selective dodging and burning.</td>', 'this picture is delightfully weird. Was the color retouched at all? The yellow sky sure is something. I would like this picture much more if the subject stood out from the background more - the trees are too contrasty and draw the eye away from the hanging girl. I guess there might not have been much you could do about it, except hope for overcast weather . . . but maybe if you''re going to work on this photo further, beyond the scope of DPC, you can do some levels adjustments and selective dodging and burning.', '2004-12-15 15:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064484, 128490, 22479, '<td valign="top">No reason to submit such a small photograph. Please remember that a larger photo (between 600-640 pixels on the long edge) equates to more detail and a better chance for an encouraging score.</td>', 'No reason to submit such a small photograph. Please remember that a larger photo (between 600-640 pixels on the long edge) equates to more detail and a better chance for an encouraging score.', '2004-12-15 15:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064485, 128492, 17507, '<td valign="top">lovely capture! I hope you didn''t have to go through too many umbrellas to get this one right :)</td>', 'lovely capture! I hope you didn''t have to go through too many umbrellas to get this one right :)', '2004-12-15 15:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064487, 128484, 29486, '<td valign="top">Nice snap shot. No real outstanding feature to make it more than that.</td>', 'Nice snap shot. No real outstanding feature to make it more than that.', '2004-12-15 15:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064488, 128013, 17507, '<td valign="top">The thick white border works really well here. Nice shot - best I''ve rated out of the ~50 I''ve seen so far.<br/></td>', 'The thick white border works really well here. Nice shot - best I''ve rated out of the ~50 I''ve seen so far.', '2004-12-15 15:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064491, 128399, 25884, '<td valign="top">it is an overall good phtograph except for the little bit of the actual shadow that you can see  on the bottom right of the pict.     8</td>', 'it is an overall good phtograph except for the little bit of the actual shadow that you can see  on the bottom right of the pict.     8', '2004-12-15 15:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064492, 127922, 17507, '<td valign="top">(lol).<br/> <br/>This shot is so silly, but it''s actually quite nice. I like the tonal range in this shot; the only thing I would change is the placement of the fan relative to the right frame. It serves as the focal point, but it''s falling out of the frame. If this was cropped down from a larger picture, this should be an easy fix..!</td>', '(lol). This shot is so silly, but it''s actually quite nice. I like the tonal range in this shot; the only thing I would change is the placement of the fan relative to the right frame. It serves as the focal point, but it''s falling out of the frame. If this was cropped down from a larger picture, this should be an easy fix..!', '2004-12-15 15:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064493, 127743, 17507, '<td valign="top">Tough shot. Great timing. I wish the crop were tighter such that the seeds that had just come off were maybe 2/3 of the way to the right of the frame instead of slightly left of center.</td>', 'Tough shot. Great timing. I wish the crop were tighter such that the seeds that had just come off were maybe 2/3 of the way to the right of the frame instead of slightly left of center.', '2004-12-15 15:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064495, 126957, 22479, '<td valign="top">Lacks fine detail. Appears to have been sharpened too zealously evidenced by strong halos around the edge details. I think you chose an interesting way to represent wind in this photo, and to your credit, it was a creative attempt. Unfortunately the execution was hampered by technical deficits.</td>', 'Lacks fine detail. Appears to have been sharpened too zealously evidenced by strong halos around the edge details. I think you chose an interesting way to represent wind in this photo, and to your credit, it was a creative attempt. Unfortunately the execution was hampered by technical deficits.', '2004-12-15 15:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064497, 128391, 29269, '<td valign="top">Good idea! NOw, the composition could have been better, I think. Applying the rule of 3rds, the horz. line between the concrete and the grass should have been placed either at the upper or a lower 1/3  of the image. Your position could have been a bit lower, to more emphasize the airborne paper.<br/>Great job on meeting the challenge, again. 6.</td>', 'Good idea! NOw, the composition could have been better, I think. Applying the rule of 3rds, the horz. line between the concrete and the grass should have been placed either at the upper or a lower 1/3  of the image. Your position could have been a bit lower, to more emphasize the airborne paper.Great job on meeting the challenge, again. 6.', '2004-12-15 15:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064498, 127083, 7889, '<td valign="top">I think if you had cropped the bottom right out, coverted it to b &amp;w and bumped up the contrast etc this would have given this more impact</td>', 'I think if you had cropped the bottom right out, coverted it to b &w and bumped up the contrast etc this would have given this more impact', '2004-12-15 15:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064501, 128399, 17507, '<td valign="top">Clever. I''m going to have to guess that the ''shadow'' is a paper cutout... I was thinking that maybe you had an external flash you fired, but then there''s be a distinct image of the pinwheel too. I like the idea.</td>', 'Clever. I''m going to have to guess that the ''shadow'' is a paper cutout... I was thinking that maybe you had an external flash you fired, but then there''s be a distinct image of the pinwheel too. I like the idea.', '2004-12-15 15:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064503, 128391, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice :)<br/>This would be the perfect sort of shot for a polaroid gallery...</td>', 'Nice :)This would be the perfect sort of shot for a polaroid gallery...', '2004-12-15 15:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064504, 127907, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good movement and colour, I can feel the wind in this. good luck</td>', 'Good movement and colour, I can feel the wind in this. good luck', '2004-12-15 15:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064507, 128338, 29269, '<td valign="top">Great choice for the difficult challenge - you were lucky to find those trees! Now, the weather wasn''t great, I could see, and that spoils the photo a bit for me. 8.</td>', 'Great choice for the difficult challenge - you were lucky to find those trees! Now, the weather wasn''t great, I could see, and that spoils the photo a bit for me. 8.', '2004-12-15 15:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064508, 127397, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in this photo. The white on almost black is very striking. However, the focal point winds up being the cones in the front. The windsock, which is the one thing in the photo that communicates the idea of wind, becomes nothing more than an incidental element in the picture. A close-up of just the windsock, with the little cones around it, might have worked better.</td>', 'I like the contrast in this photo. The white on almost black is very striking. However, the focal point winds up being the cones in the front. The windsock, which is the one thing in the photo that communicates the idea of wind, becomes nothing more than an incidental element in the picture. A close-up of just the windsock, with the little cones around it, might have worked better.', '2004-12-15 15:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064513, 127807, 17507, '<td valign="top">I think this might actually have worked better with a high shutter speed. The curling of the ribbons would probably have made it clear that they were being blown. Here there is nothing well enough in focus to make a compelling focal point for the picture. Still... it''s way better than the zillions of flag photos in this challenge... :)</td>', 'I think this might actually have worked better with a high shutter speed. The curling of the ribbons would probably have made it clear that they were being blown. Here there is nothing well enough in focus to make a compelling focal point for the picture. Still... it''s way better than the zillions of flag photos in this challenge... :)', '2004-12-15 16:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064514, 128174, 29269, '<td valign="top">This should be a ribbon winner, given the competition. I don''t care too much for non-standard aspect ratios, especially when it doesn''t seem to do much for the image. I would have cropped the lower part, probably all 2/3rds of the gravel below the bottom grass line. That would have also put the object more towards the lower 3rd, removing it from the almost vertical center of the image. 9.</td>', 'This should be a ribbon winner, given the competition. I don''t care too much for non-standard aspect ratios, especially when it doesn''t seem to do much for the image. I would have cropped the lower part, probably all 2/3rds of the gravel below the bottom grass line. That would have also put the object more towards the lower 3rd, removing it from the almost vertical center of the image. 9.', '2004-12-15 16:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064515, 128035, 17507, '<td valign="top">Loose cropping on this photo greatly detracts from its impact.</td>', 'Loose cropping on this photo greatly detracts from its impact.', '2004-12-15 16:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064516, 128174, 27375, '<td valign="top">That hat looks familiar, this is a really cool shot. Good work once again</td>', 'That hat looks familiar, this is a really cool shot. Good work once again', '2004-12-15 16:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064517, 127344, 22479, '<td valign="top">JPEG compression a bit too harsh I''m afraid. There are unsightly artifacts introduced by the compression settings when you saved this file.<br/> <br/>I think this is adequately meets the challenge requirements. Technical deficits unfortunately detract from this photo.</td>', 'JPEG compression a bit too harsh I''m afraid. There are unsightly artifacts introduced by the compression settings when you saved this file. I think this is adequately meets the challenge requirements. Technical deficits unfortunately detract from this photo.', '2004-12-15 16:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064518, 128409, 17507, '<td valign="top">cute :)</td>', 'cute :)', '2004-12-15 16:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064521, 127503, 17507, '<td valign="top">The hat is a subtley of this picture, and I like that it''s right at the end of that arm of clouds. That the guy''s head just clears the treeline is also a nice compositional element.<br/>I like this one a lot :)<br/></td>', 'The hat is a subtley of this picture, and I like that it''s right at the end of that arm of clouds. That the guy''s head just clears the treeline is also a nice compositional element.I like this one a lot :)', '2004-12-15 16:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064523, 127930, 17507, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but baaaad lens flare.</td>', 'Cool shot, but baaaad lens flare.', '2004-12-15 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064525, 128037, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but the wind isn''t too clear... if there were a snowy cap being blown off one of the mountains, I think it would meet the challenge much better.</td>', 'Great shot, but the wind isn''t too clear... if there were a snowy cap being blown off one of the mountains, I think it would meet the challenge much better.', '2004-12-15 16:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064526, 127546, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''ll look forward to reading the comments on this one -- quite an interesting setup!  One of two 10s for me this time around.</td>', 'I''ll look forward to reading the comments on this one -- quite an interesting setup!  One of two 10s for me this time around.', '2004-12-15 16:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064527, 128398, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; simple... nice toning... meets challenge well... hot babe... all adds up to a 10 from me!</td>', 'Nice & simple... nice toning... meets challenge well... hot babe... all adds up to a 10 from me!', '2004-12-15 16:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064528, 128174, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  I assume he jumped into that position, and you probably had a good number of attempts to get this one right!</td>', 'Nicely done!  I assume he jumped into that position, and you probably had a good number of attempts to get this one right!', '2004-12-15 16:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064531, 128489, 29269, '<td valign="top">Great image, well matching the challenge. I am not sure what the original colors were, but given that the kites are usually colorful and most likely contrast both the sky and the sand well, I wonder if the color image would have been better here. 8.</td>', 'Great image, well matching the challenge. I am not sure what the original colors were, but given that the kites are usually colorful and most likely contrast both the sky and the sand well, I wonder if the color image would have been better here. 8.', '2004-12-15 16:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064532, 128490, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not a tremendously compelling shot, I''m afraid...</td>', 'Not a tremendously compelling shot, I''m afraid...', '2004-12-15 16:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064536, 127985, 22479, '<td valign="top">Well, after careful consideration of all the flag photos, I will give you the Pulitzer prize for Best Flag in Inconsequential Photojournalism. Well done.</td>', 'Well, after careful consideration of all the flag photos, I will give you the Pulitzer prize for Best Flag in Inconsequential Photojournalism. Well done.', '2004-12-15 16:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064537, 127732, 29269, '<td valign="top">I wish for the livelier colors of the sky and the water. Also, it looks like the boat is slightly out of focus (by looking at the line between the red and white) That takes ranking away from potentially high-placement photo. only 6.</td>', 'I wish for the livelier colors of the sky and the water. Also, it looks like the boat is slightly out of focus (by looking at the line between the red and white) That takes ranking away from potentially high-placement photo. only 6.', '2004-12-15 16:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064543, 127522, 22479, '<td valign="top">Pampas grass (and variations on this theme) seems to be a popular subject this time around.<br/> <br/>Returning for further comments. <br/> <br/>I like your B&amp;W treatment of this photograph. Nice exposure and tonal range. Focus appears to be a little soft on the leaves and stalks. Nicely captured to sufficiently convey your message summarized in your title. The sky lacks depth to give this picture more of an interesting framework. I feel that''s the largest shortcoming of this otherwise excellent photograph.</td>', 'Pampas grass (and variations on this theme) seems to be a popular subject this time around. Returning for further comments.  I like your B&W treatment of this photograph. Nice exposure and tonal range. Focus appears to be a little soft on the leaves and stalks. Nicely captured to sufficiently convey your message summarized in your title. The sky lacks depth to give this picture more of an interesting framework. I feel that''s the largest shortcoming of this otherwise excellent photograph.', '2004-12-15 16:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064549, 128491, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, almost the best of the grass blowing in the wind entries. My beef with this from an artistic viewpoint is the skewed horizon. Purely an artistic and subjective distraction in my opinion. You and others may disagree, but ultimately that''s my final impression. Nice job with the interesting sky and composition otherwise. Tonal range is very pleasing and the image has just the right amount of sharpness, detail, and motion blur. Well done.</td>', 'I like this a lot, almost the best of the grass blowing in the wind entries. My beef with this from an artistic viewpoint is the skewed horizon. Purely an artistic and subjective distraction in my opinion. You and others may disagree, but ultimately that''s my final impression. Nice job with the interesting sky and composition otherwise. Tonal range is very pleasing and the image has just the right amount of sharpness, detail, and motion blur. Well done.', '2004-12-15 16:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064553, 128244, 22479, '<td valign="top">Returning for a revisit. I think this sky is quite fascinating and your post processing almost lends a surreal beauty. I think you did a good job in creating a lot of drama here. I question whether you used gradient density effects on this image, as under basic editing rules, that is to my understanding forbidden. I''ll assume your editing steps were within the limits of the challenge rules. Well done!</td>', 'Returning for a revisit. I think this sky is quite fascinating and your post processing almost lends a surreal beauty. I think you did a good job in creating a lot of drama here. I question whether you used gradient density effects on this image, as under basic editing rules, that is to my understanding forbidden. I''ll assume your editing steps were within the limits of the challenge rules. Well done!', '2004-12-15 16:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064554, 127510, 22479, '<td valign="top">I am curious how you achieved this particular sky. Appears unnervingly dark against the bright waves. Quite interesting drama and excellent composition overall. Strong on technical aspects. Appropriate to challenge theme.</td>', 'I am curious how you achieved this particular sky. Appears unnervingly dark against the bright waves. Quite interesting drama and excellent composition overall. Strong on technical aspects. Appropriate to challenge theme.', '2004-12-15 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064556, 128370, 22479, '<td valign="top">Paradise in a click of a button. Well captured. Excellent tonal range and depth.</td>', 'Paradise in a click of a button. Well captured. Excellent tonal range and depth.', '2004-12-15 16:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064559, 128480, 22479, '<td valign="top">Beautiful exposure. Some haloing around the subject which is likely secondary to aggressive sharpening. Well composed and framed.</td>', 'Beautiful exposure. Some haloing around the subject which is likely secondary to aggressive sharpening. Well composed and framed.', '2004-12-15 16:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064563, 127503, 22479, '<td valign="top">Great timing. I wonder how many outtakes this took. :)<br/> <br/>Sky is quite dramatic and lends itself quite nicely to add interesting drama to this shot. Clouds almost appear to carry the hat away off into the breeze.</td>', 'Great timing. I wonder how many outtakes this took. :) Sky is quite dramatic and lends itself quite nicely to add interesting drama to this shot. Clouds almost appear to carry the hat away off into the breeze.', '2004-12-15 16:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064567, 128451, 29777, '<td valign="top">great color. Interesting crop.</td>', 'great color. Interesting crop.', '2004-12-15 16:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064569, 128147, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice shift in hue. Creates a fantasy world. Interesting perspective, pose, and strong on technical aspects.</td>', 'Nice shift in hue. Creates a fantasy world. Interesting perspective, pose, and strong on technical aspects.', '2004-12-15 16:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064572, 128174, 22479, '<td valign="top">Ah, quite an effective shot. This guy''s talented. Must have taken some effort to get this to look right. Well done! I think the backdrop is quite dramatic and adds much interest to this shot. Wonderful.</td>', 'Ah, quite an effective shot. This guy''s talented. Must have taken some effort to get this to look right. Well done! I think the backdrop is quite dramatic and adds much interest to this shot. Wonderful.', '2004-12-15 16:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064575, 128452, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like the photos colors very much. It took be a while to see the relationship to the challenge. This looks like a difficult shot.</td>', 'I like the photos colors very much. It took be a while to see the relationship to the challenge. This looks like a difficult shot.', '2004-12-15 16:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064580, 127817, 29777, '<td valign="top">very cool, (pun)</td>', 'very cool, (pun)', '2004-12-15 16:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064581, 128351, 22479, '<td valign="top">Well done. Elegant simplicity, gracefully executed in an artistically and technically pleasing manner. Excellent backdrop to contrast with the falling feather. Your title is kinda hokey though.</td>', 'Well done. Elegant simplicity, gracefully executed in an artistically and technically pleasing manner. Excellent backdrop to contrast with the falling feather. Your title is kinda hokey though.', '2004-12-15 16:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064585, 128348, 29777, '<td valign="top">The background is simple, yet distracting at the same time. I don''t find the image to be very interesting. It seems very plain. I do like the colors. The reds bring things together.</td>', 'The background is simple, yet distracting at the same time. I don''t find the image to be very interesting. It seems very plain. I do like the colors. The reds bring things together.', '2004-12-15 16:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064586, 127867, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice study in contrasting energy harnessing as well as a strong message in the pressing need for dependance on non-renewable sources of power. Well done.</td>', 'Nice study in contrasting energy harnessing as well as a strong message in the pressing need for dependance on non-renewable sources of power. Well done.', '2004-12-15 16:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064590, 128409, 29777, '<td valign="top">I''ve got a soft spot for any photos with kids.  good work. I like this image very much. The stillness of the water, the sharp focus on the boat, the softness of the face. It seems a bit dark to me, but I''m not sure how to punch it up without creating a distracting background.</td>', 'I''ve got a soft spot for any photos with kids.  good work. I like this image very much. The stillness of the water, the sharp focus on the boat, the softness of the face. It seems a bit dark to me, but I''m not sure how to punch it up without creating a distracting background.', '2004-12-15 16:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064597, 128174, 29777, '<td valign="top">Clever. I''d like to read about how you shot this. I had considered something like this myself but I couldn''t figure out how to make it convincing. The scarves add a lot as do the clouds.</td>', 'Clever. I''d like to read about how you shot this. I had considered something like this myself but I couldn''t figure out how to make it convincing. The scarves add a lot as do the clouds.', '2004-12-15 16:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064601, 127052, 29777, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Super sharp. good work.</td>', 'Very nice. Super sharp. good work.', '2004-12-15 16:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064606, 127546, 29777, '<td valign="top">I thought these were toys when I looked at the thumbnail image. Very nice work.</td>', 'I thought these were toys when I looked at the thumbnail image. Very nice work.', '2004-12-15 16:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064620, 128213, 29777, '<td valign="top">a bit spooky but not very interesting.</td>', 'a bit spooky but not very interesting.', '2004-12-15 17:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064621, 128448, 29777, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2004-12-15 17:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064631, 127907, 26526, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset photograph! Superb ligthing use, so diffilcult to obtain shooting toward the sun.  Like the orange and gold colors. Like the dof used to show grasses blowing in the wind. Very well done!</td>', 'Beautiful sunset photograph! Superb ligthing use, so diffilcult to obtain shooting toward the sun.  Like the orange and gold colors. Like the dof used to show grasses blowing in the wind. Very well done!', '2004-12-15 17:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064633, 128369, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this blowing flag. Love how it cropped, composed. Striking use of red, white, and blue colors. Like the dof, sharp flag, soft background sky. My favorite flag photo in this challenge.</td>', 'I like the perspective of this blowing flag. Love how it cropped, composed. Striking use of red, white, and blue colors. Like the dof, sharp flag, soft background sky. My favorite flag photo in this challenge.', '2004-12-15 17:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064639, 127907, 30659, '<td valign="top">nice colors but where''s the focus?</td>', 'nice colors but where''s the focus?', '2004-12-15 17:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064643, 128493, 30659, '<td valign="top">good doggie... look out the window... stay... say cheese...</td>', 'good doggie... look out the window... stay... say cheese...', '2004-12-15 17:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064645, 128076, 30659, '<td valign="top">thats a pretty strong "A Different Kind of Wind" :D points on the humor. it would''ve been better if you used a 1ply better effect i think</td>', 'thats a pretty strong "A Different Kind of Wind" :D points on the humor. it would''ve been better if you used a 1ply better effect i think', '2004-12-15 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064652, 127743, 13749, '<td valign="top">very interesting concept - too bad that the seeds somewhat blend in with the white cloud background.  there also seems to be some loss of sharpness - almost looks as if you''ve blown the photo up from its initial size.</td>', 'very interesting concept - too bad that the seeds somewhat blend in with the white cloud background.  there also seems to be some loss of sharpness - almost looks as if you''ve blown the photo up from its initial size.', '2004-12-15 17:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064665, 127757, 26526, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. Excellent composition. Like the color. Perfect focus used. Implies wind, not showing it, or I would have voted it one spot higher. Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. Excellent composition. Like the color. Perfect focus used. Implies wind, not showing it, or I would have voted it one spot higher. Well done!', '2004-12-15 17:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064676, 128480, 26526, '<td valign="top">Very creative take on wind. Excellent photograph technically. Like the composition, dof.  Great lighting on the subject''s face and hands on the musical instrument. I just don''t see or hear the effects of wind in this photo, or I would have voted it higher. Very well done!</td>', 'Very creative take on wind. Excellent photograph technically. Like the composition, dof.  Great lighting on the subject''s face and hands on the musical instrument. I just don''t see or hear the effects of wind in this photo, or I would have voted it higher. Very well done!', '2004-12-15 17:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064680, 127510, 23456, '<td valign="top">You can tell it is windy...nice capture ! 6</td>', 'You can tell it is windy...nice capture ! 6', '2004-12-15 17:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064682, 128338, 26526, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph. Like the color, like the softer focus. Great title. I think these trees grow this way wind blown for decades. I just don''t see wind blowing at the time this photograph taken. Otherwise, great photograph!</td>', 'I really like this photograph. Like the color, like the softer focus. Great title. I think these trees grow this way wind blown for decades. I just don''t see wind blowing at the time this photograph taken. Otherwise, great photograph!', '2004-12-15 17:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064684, 128489, 23456, '<td valign="top">I think this would look even better cropped in a little more!</td>', 'I think this would look even better cropped in a little more!', '2004-12-15 17:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064689, 127606, 23456, '<td valign="top">nice capture, just a bit too dark.</td>', 'nice capture, just a bit too dark.', '2004-12-15 17:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064691, 128161, 27293, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition. I would try to perhaps show movement of the turbines somehow, maybe with motion blur and with rear curtain flash or something. Not sure whether that would be doable under the circumstances.</td>', 'Awesome composition. I would try to perhaps show movement of the turbines somehow, maybe with motion blur and with rear curtain flash or something. Not sure whether that would be doable under the circumstances.', '2004-12-15 17:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064692, 127510, 27293, '<td valign="top">Despite this being a good shot, it shows more of the water than the wind... I do realize wind plays an important part in generation of the waves, but that''s just not obvious from this shot.</td>', 'Despite this being a good shot, it shows more of the water than the wind... I do realize wind plays an important part in generation of the waves, but that''s just not obvious from this shot.', '2004-12-15 17:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064693, 128293, 23456, '<td valign="top">striking cloud formation</td>', 'striking cloud formation', '2004-12-15 17:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064696, 128244, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like the color, contrast, captured in this dramatic photograph.  Ok, so the wind may be blowing in the sky, moving the clouds, but I see no evidence in this photo that is blowing on earth. I know, nit picking, so I''ll bump it up a place.</td>', 'Like the color, contrast, captured in this dramatic photograph.  Ok, so the wind may be blowing in the sky, moving the clouds, but I see no evidence in this photo that is blowing on earth. I know, nit picking, so I''ll bump it up a place.', '2004-12-15 18:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064704, 127786, 27293, '<td valign="top">The light on this shot is not very good... kills all the potential, imo.</td>', 'The light on this shot is not very good... kills all the potential, imo.', '2004-12-15 18:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064709, 128292, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, I''d liked to have seen a little more contrast in the image (more highlights)</td>', 'Interesting effect, I''d liked to have seen a little more contrast in the image (more highlights)', '2004-12-15 18:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064712, 127565, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Shot is a little dark. A second or third light source would''ve been helpful.</td>', 'Great idea! Shot is a little dark. A second or third light source would''ve been helpful.', '2004-12-15 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064714, 127921, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice. I would''ve liked to see a little more highlights in this photo. Tip of the mast is cut off, wish it wasn''t. I was going to submit a similiar photo to this challenge but didn''t, best of luck to you.</td>', 'Nice. I would''ve liked to see a little more highlights in this photo. Tip of the mast is cut off, wish it wasn''t. I was going to submit a similiar photo to this challenge but didn''t, best of luck to you.', '2004-12-15 18:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064717, 127620, 14656, '<td valign="top">Good capture, very subtle hint of "wind." Pleasing composition. Background seems a little dark for my taste.</td>', 'Good capture, very subtle hint of "wind." Pleasing composition. Background seems a little dark for my taste.', '2004-12-15 18:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064718, 127839, 14656, '<td valign="top">Good idea in theory but not a picture I''d like to hang on my wall. A little dark and the motion blur seems to detract from the image, rather than adding to it.</td>', 'Good idea in theory but not a picture I''d like to hang on my wall. A little dark and the motion blur seems to detract from the image, rather than adding to it.', '2004-12-15 18:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064719, 128421, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very humorous! Looks like Frosty''s about to push Santa next ;)</td>', 'Very humorous! Looks like Frosty''s about to push Santa next ;)', '2004-12-15 18:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064720, 128434, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Lighting is a little harsh from the flash and the blown out sky.</td>', 'Great capture. Lighting is a little harsh from the flash and the blown out sky.', '2004-12-15 18:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064721, 127743, 29557, '<td valign="top">bit too out of focus for me<br/></td>', 'bit too out of focus for me', '2004-12-15 18:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064723, 128433, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like the color in this flag photograph, the motion blur from wind. I would like to see one area in focus, the stars. Perhaps try for a little deeper dof. I know, easier said than done on a flapping flag at night. Experiment on shutter speed and apeture settings, within the limits of your camera. I get a lot of shots like this using my digital camera in auto. Have to go into manual mode to stop some of the motion in very low light, moving subject, situations. Good luck!</td>', 'I like the color in this flag photograph, the motion blur from wind. I would like to see one area in focus, the stars. Perhaps try for a little deeper dof. I know, easier said than done on a flapping flag at night. Experiment on shutter speed and apeture settings, within the limits of your camera. I get a lot of shots like this using my digital camera in auto. Have to go into manual mode to stop some of the motion in very low light, moving subject, situations. Good luck!', '2004-12-15 18:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064724, 128351, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, I was going to submit something similar. Feather is positioned a little high in the frame and I wish it wasn''t cut off in the upper left. Best of luck to you.</td>', 'Nice macro, I was going to submit something similar. Feather is positioned a little high in the frame and I wish it wasn''t cut off in the upper left. Best of luck to you.', '2004-12-15 18:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064726, 127911, 14656, '<td valign="top">Good way to make a pet picture work! ;) You have a lovely model.</td>', 'Good way to make a pet picture work! ;) You have a lovely model.', '2004-12-15 18:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064727, 128304, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice tones in the background. The reflection of the flame and that dust speck detract from this otherwise excellent photo.</td>', 'Nice tones in the background. The reflection of the flame and that dust speck detract from this otherwise excellent photo.', '2004-12-15 18:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064729, 126934, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice colors on a great sunset. This photo fails to depict wind for me.</td>', 'Nice colors on a great sunset. This photo fails to depict wind for me.', '2004-12-15 18:25:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1064731, 128035, 14656, '<td valign="top">Good idea. A different point of view may have been better. I don''t see any "wind" but the implication is there so you meet the challenge.</td>', 'Good idea. A different point of view may have been better. I don''t see any "wind" but the implication is there so you meet the challenge.', '2004-12-15 18:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064733, 128433, 14656, '<td valign="top">Noisy. //www.neatimage.com</td>', 'Noisy. //www.neatimage.com', '2004-12-15 18:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064734, 128033, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2004-12-15 18:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064737, 128466, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice photo although the relation to the challenge is almost completely non-exisitant without the title.</td>', 'Nice photo although the relation to the challenge is almost completely non-exisitant without the title.', '2004-12-15 18:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064740, 127003, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like this photograph in b&amp;w. Looks set up to me. The stiff angle of the coat tails. Held in place? The backward turned umbrella, but nothing is blown out of place from wind on the bystanders.  A very creative and fun shot. I''ll give you another point for that.</td>', 'Like this photograph in b&w. Looks set up to me. The stiff angle of the coat tails. Held in place? The backward turned umbrella, but nothing is blown out of place from wind on the bystanders.  A very creative and fun shot. I''ll give you another point for that.', '2004-12-15 18:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064741, 128452, 14656, '<td valign="top">Ouch, my eyes! I''m failing to see any wind, other than the ripples on the water. Weak connection to the challenge.</td>', 'Ouch, my eyes! I''m failing to see any wind, other than the ripples on the water. Weak connection to the challenge.', '2004-12-15 18:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064744, 128042, 14656, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast would''ve been nice. The heavy black border does nothing for me.</td>', 'A little more contrast would''ve been nice. The heavy black border does nothing for me.', '2004-12-15 18:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064746, 127681, 14656, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Wish the image wasn''t cropped so tightly on the left and the top. Would''ve been great to see this at full 640px.</td>', 'Excellent! Wish the image wasn''t cropped so tightly on the left and the top. Would''ve been great to see this at full 640px.', '2004-12-15 18:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064753, 127453, 26526, '<td valign="top">I like this flag photograph. Great composition.  LIke the color, and focus used. Well done.</td>', 'I like this flag photograph. Great composition.  LIke the color, and focus used. Well done.', '2004-12-15 18:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064756, 128143, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great title for this picture! Wish his face wasn''t shaded.</td>', 'Great title for this picture! Wish his face wasn''t shaded.', '2004-12-15 18:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064757, 127723, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Impression of wind is a little weak, I need something more dramatic.</td>', 'Great capture. Impression of wind is a little weak, I need something more dramatic.', '2004-12-15 18:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064760, 127665, 14656, '<td valign="top">The focal point of your photo seems to be the water splashing against the wall which would be caused by waves or current, not really wind IMO.</td>', 'The focal point of your photo seems to be the water splashing against the wall which would be caused by waves or current, not really wind IMO.', '2004-12-15 18:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064761, 127886, 14656, '<td valign="top">Failing to see wind, other than the ripples on the water which equates to a weak entry. Your focal point seems to be the Christmas lights, not the water. At least in my eyes the point of interest are the lights.</td>', 'Failing to see wind, other than the ripples on the water which equates to a weak entry. Your focal point seems to be the Christmas lights, not the water. At least in my eyes the point of interest are the lights.', '2004-12-15 18:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064764, 128412, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great capture, cute model.</td>', 'Great capture, cute model.', '2004-12-15 18:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064767, 127849, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective used in this photograph. Good color and dof. I would have rated it higher if I could see more of the leaves blowing around at the time it taken. <br/>Perhaps a different crop, focusing on the few moving leaves. Good photograph.</td>', 'Like the perspective used in this photograph. Good color and dof. I would have rated it higher if I could see more of the leaves blowing around at the time it taken. Perhaps a different crop, focusing on the few moving leaves. Good photograph.', '2004-12-15 18:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064768, 127628, 14656, '<td valign="top">*Groans* Not another flag shot.. Although I''ve voted on several so far, this is the best one yet. Sky is blown out.. Flag and pole are a little dark. Upping the levels to brighten it should help, the sky can''t get any worse than it is.</td>', '*Groans* Not another flag shot.. Although I''ve voted on several so far, this is the best one yet. Sky is blown out.. Flag and pole are a little dark. Upping the levels to brighten it should help, the sky can''t get any worse than it is.', '2004-12-15 18:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064770, 128174, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Would''ve been more believable had the brush in the background been blowing as well ;)</td>', 'Great capture. Would''ve been more believable had the brush in the background been blowing as well ;)', '2004-12-15 18:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064771, 127472, 14656, '<td valign="top">Seems very still to me.</td>', 'Seems very still to me.', '2004-12-15 18:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064772, 127081, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nice warm tones, excellent DOF. Best of luck to you!</td>', 'Great colors, nice warm tones, excellent DOF. Best of luck to you!', '2004-12-15 18:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064773, 127746, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very moody but this photo feels like the calm before the storm = still.</td>', 'Very moody but this photo feels like the calm before the storm = still.', '2004-12-15 18:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064775, 128149, 14656, '<td valign="top">Lens flares are a little harsh and overexposed. A narrower aperture would''ve helped. Focus seems a little soft. 3 orange dots on the bottom right could''ve been cropped out.</td>', 'Lens flares are a little harsh and overexposed. A narrower aperture would''ve helped. Focus seems a little soft. 3 orange dots on the bottom right could''ve been cropped out.', '2004-12-15 18:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064776, 128304, 19474, '<td valign="top">that is the perfect way to show a wind blowen flame nice and clearly.. rotate a candle shoot and rotate the pic back<br/>I think the problem with this shot is that the background is too close.. a black background further away would have isolated the flame much better<br/>and the drip of wax is on the wrong side if the wind is blowing from the right... no drip would be better<br/>but still worth a " 7 " good job</td>', 'that is the perfect way to show a wind blowen flame nice and clearly.. rotate a candle shoot and rotate the pic backI think the problem with this shot is that the background is too close.. a black background further away would have isolated the flame much betterand the drip of wax is on the wrong side if the wind is blowing from the right... no drip would be betterbut still worth a " 7 " good job', '2004-12-15 18:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064778, 128400, 7291, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time finding the wind in this foto.  I''m sure you meant to show your own interpretation but I can''t find it.</td>', 'I''m having a hard time finding the wind in this foto.  I''m sure you meant to show your own interpretation but I can''t find it.', '2004-12-15 18:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064779, 127907, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice use of gradient.  Did you use a filter or Photoshop?</td>', 'Nice use of gradient.  Did you use a filter or Photoshop?', '2004-12-15 18:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064781, 127930, 13156, '<td valign="top">Way too much lens flare for my taste. Picture would have been very good without it.</td>', 'Way too much lens flare for my taste. Picture would have been very good without it.', '2004-12-15 18:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064785, 128249, 26526, '<td valign="top">Nice angle in this flag photograph. Shows wind motion. Perhaps a little sharper focus on the pole, stars. But, in my opinion, fhis flag in color would have much more emotional impact, since it the subject of this photograph. More "wow" factor.</td>', 'Nice angle in this flag photograph. Shows wind motion. Perhaps a little sharper focus on the pole, stars. But, in my opinion, fhis flag in color would have much more emotional impact, since it the subject of this photograph. More "wow" factor.', '2004-12-15 18:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064786, 128491, 7291, '<td valign="top">I like this one very much.  It''s calming and you can almost hear the breeze.  Great picture.  Excellent use of an extended shutter speed for effect as well. - 9</td>', 'I like this one very much.  It''s calming and you can almost hear the breeze.  Great picture.  Excellent use of an extended shutter speed for effect as well. - 9', '2004-12-15 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064788, 128434, 7291, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m wrong here, but this looks edited.</td>', 'I''m sure I''m wrong here, but this looks edited.', '2004-12-15 18:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064791, 127003, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent setup, but it looks pretty abvious when you look at it.  I"ll give extra points for the effort.</td>', 'Excellent setup, but it looks pretty abvious when you look at it.  I"ll give extra points for the effort.', '2004-12-15 18:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064821, 127986, 20667, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2004-12-15 19:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064823, 127053, 29339, '<td valign="top">This photograph made me laugh out loud, so it deserves high marks just for that.<br/> <br/>It''s well done too.  Nice conversion to black and white.  Good job on the sky.</td>', 'This photograph made me laugh out loud, so it deserves high marks just for that. It''s well done too.  Nice conversion to black and white.  Good job on the sky.', '2004-12-15 19:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
