(1064903, 128311, 20779, '<td valign="top">Now this is art through a photographer''s eye. This stirs you and makes you feel the breeze and wonder what has taken place in this room through the years. The post-processing is sheer perfection for my personal tastes.  This is the kind of photography I wish I could see so much more often on DPC. Thanks for a great shot.</td>', 'Now this is art through a photographer''s eye. This stirs you and makes you feel the breeze and wonder what has taken place in this room through the years. The post-processing is sheer perfection for my personal tastes.  This is the kind of photography I wish I could see so much more often on DPC. Thanks for a great shot.', '2004-12-15 20:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1064910, 128351, 20941, '<td valign="top">Great title and excellent idea  for a subject one I wish I had thought of! IMHO if this had been composed to show the feather floating freely without an implication that someone might be holding it... with a natural sky backround this would be a top contender for me. As it is nicly done!</td>', 'Great title and excellent idea  for a subject one I wish I had thought of! IMHO if this had been composed to show the feather floating freely without an implication that someone might be holding it... with a natural sky backround this would be a top contender for me. As it is nicly done!', '2004-12-15 20:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
