(1065061, 127977, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this does a good job of showing wind.  I wonder if it might have been even more effective if shot in the vertical direction to show more ot the bend in the plant.<br/></td>', 'I think this does a good job of showing wind.  I wonder if it might have been even more effective if shot in the vertical direction to show more ot the bend in the plant.', '2004-12-15 23:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065065, 128351, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and using the rot, creating an unbalanced negative space at the bottom.  There are two things that I have a minor problem with.  The compostion imples symetry to me, the way it''s cut different on the left than one the right is a littel bothersome.  There is a lot of noice in the blue part of the image.  Both are minor nits and are just my opinion - overall, good job.</td>', 'I like the colors and using the rot, creating an unbalanced negative space at the bottom.  There are two things that I have a minor problem with.  The compostion imples symetry to me, the way it''s cut different on the left than one the right is a littel bothersome.  There is a lot of noice in the blue part of the image.  Both are minor nits and are just my opinion - overall, good job.', '2004-12-15 23:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065066, 128231, 18799, '<td valign="top">The lighting doesn''t work well for me.  It''s too dark.  Also, while a fan implies wind (when it''s on), this doesn''t say wind to me because there is nothing fighting the air currents.</td>', 'The lighting doesn''t work well for me.  It''s too dark.  Also, while a fan implies wind (when it''s on), this doesn''t say wind to me because there is nothing fighting the air currents.', '2004-12-15 23:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065067, 127766, 18799, '<td valign="top">s the challenge.  The colors seem a little flat on my monitor, I''m wondering if the saturation/contrast could have been bumped just a bit to make the image "pop"</td>', 's the challenge.  The colors seem a little flat on my monitor, I''m wondering if the saturation/contrast could have been bumped just a bit to make the image "pop"', '2004-12-15 23:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065073, 128035, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is really close to being a very good image.  The problems are mostly not your fault, the wires cutting across horizontally.  I think I would have liked the shot better if the angle caused the leading structure to be on the extreme left and the others to trail off into the distance from there creating a diagonal line from corner to corner.  Those smaller ones in the back don''t do anydthing but add clutter.  My only other nitpik is that while these work with the wind, wind isn''t evident in this photo.  Maybe if the shutter were slower show some blurring of the blades?  <br/>Anyway, this is a good effort.  7</td>', 'This is really close to being a very good image.  The problems are mostly not your fault, the wires cutting across horizontally.  I think I would have liked the shot better if the angle caused the leading structure to be on the extreme left and the others to trail off into the distance from there creating a diagonal line from corner to corner.  Those smaller ones in the back don''t do anydthing but add clutter.  My only other nitpik is that while these work with the wind, wind isn''t evident in this photo.  Maybe if the shutter were slower show some blurring of the blades?  Anyway, this is a good effort.  7', '2004-12-15 23:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065075, 128113, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo of the "results" of the wind, I don''t really "see" the wind.  For all I know, the tree could have been cut at the bottom.  Just an observation that I''m not marking you down for.</td>', 'This is a good photo of the "results" of the wind, I don''t really "see" the wind.  For all I know, the tree could have been cut at the bottom.  Just an observation that I''m not marking you down for.', '2004-12-15 23:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065077, 128141, 18799, '<td valign="top">I know your title says it, but I can''t see it.  Without the title, I wouldn''t be able to associate wind with the photo because the people are too small for me to see what they are doing.   I really like the photo from a human interest aspect though, the compositon and colors are terrific. 6</td>', 'I know your title says it, but I can''t see it.  Without the title, I wouldn''t be able to associate wind with the photo because the people are too small for me to see what they are doing.   I really like the photo from a human interest aspect though, the compositon and colors are terrific. 6', '2004-12-15 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065078, 127546, 18799, '<td valign="top">Points for the effort setting this up.  It does have a very "staged" look to it.  6</td>', 'Points for the effort setting this up.  It does have a very "staged" look to it.  6', '2004-12-15 23:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065080, 128299, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  I find the fense quite distracting.  I would hate to loose the ground but I might try to crop out the fense.  It is sort of like the ever present power lines that I usually find in my great landscapse, but of course, it''s a fense.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  I find the fense quite distracting.  I would hate to loose the ground but I might try to crop out the fense.  It is sort of like the ever present power lines that I usually find in my great landscapse, but of course, it''s a fense.', '2004-12-15 23:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065082, 128173, 18799, '<td valign="top">The centered compositon and the focus issues hurt this for me.  Plus, the way the smoke is rising straight up, the wind doesn''t appear to be much of a factor either.</td>', 'The centered compositon and the focus issues hurt this for me.  Plus, the way the smoke is rising straight up, the wind doesn''t appear to be much of a factor either.', '2004-12-15 23:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065084, 128392, 18799, '<td valign="top">Say''s wind, but not very captivating to me.   5</td>', 'Say''s wind, but not very captivating to me.   5', '2004-12-15 23:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065089, 127786, 18799, '<td valign="top">The pose looks uncomfortable and the facial expression is pretty uninspired.  I think it would have been better with a different choice of location.  The interior wall and the resulting shadows hurt the shot for me.</td>', 'The pose looks uncomfortable and the facial expression is pretty uninspired.  I think it would have been better with a different choice of location.  The interior wall and the resulting shadows hurt the shot for me.', '2004-12-15 23:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065090, 127468, 18799, '<td valign="top">This does say wind, and therefor meets the challenge.  The interest level really isn''t there for me though.  There really isn''t anything in the image to make me want to stay and look around.   5</td>', 'This does say wind, and therefor meets the challenge.  The interest level really isn''t there for me though.  There really isn''t anything in the image to make me want to stay and look around.   5', '2004-12-15 23:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065095, 128013, 19810, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and sharpness!  Very well done!</td>', 'Excellent colors and sharpness!  Very well done!', '2004-12-15 23:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065097, 127510, 19810, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Great shot!!</td>', 'Stunning!  Great shot!!', '2004-12-15 23:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065098, 128489, 18799, '<td valign="top">Definately say''s wind!  I''m kind of curious about your choice of converting to sepia with such and obviously colorful object.</td>', 'Definately say''s wind!  I''m kind of curious about your choice of converting to sepia with such and obviously colorful object.', '2004-12-15 23:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065099, 128319, 19810, '<td valign="top">A shallow DOF would have improved this image significantly -- the background being in focus tends to get a bit distracting.</td>', 'A shallow DOF would have improved this image significantly -- the background being in focus tends to get a bit distracting.', '2004-12-15 23:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065101, 128073, 18799, '<td valign="top">My eyes are drawn right to the border in this shot - I think it''s a little to powerful.  The shot does meet the challenge though and exposure and focus are right on.  If this were advanced challenge, I would remove the extra flagpole.   7</td>', 'My eyes are drawn right to the border in this shot - I think it''s a little to powerful.  The shot does meet the challenge though and exposure and focus are right on.  If this were advanced challenge, I would remove the extra flagpole.   7', '2004-12-15 23:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065102, 127895, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good job with the interpretation.  The comp. is good, and I like the angle of the bubbles.  What could be improved, in my opinion, is the brick wall in the background is a distraction, and there is a green cast to the skintone.  7</td>', 'Good job with the interpretation.  The comp. is good, and I like the angle of the bubbles.  What could be improved, in my opinion, is the brick wall in the background is a distraction, and there is a green cast to the skintone.  7', '2004-12-15 23:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065105, 128033, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretaion.  I think the white balance is a little off and exposer could have been bumped up a notch or two.  6</td>', 'Interesting interpretaion.  I think the white balance is a little off and exposer could have been bumped up a notch or two.  6', '2004-12-15 23:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065106, 128076, 19810, '<td valign="top">Eeew!  LOL</td>', 'Eeew!  LOL', '2004-12-15 23:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065108, 127812, 29777, '<td valign="top">I like the Silhouette. I think the out of focus and stray bit on the right take away from the impact. This makes me think of a nursery rather than wind.</td>', 'I like the Silhouette. I think the out of focus and stray bit on the right take away from the impact. This makes me think of a nursery rather than wind.', '2004-12-15 23:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065110, 128398, 29777, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadows and composition.</td>', 'Interesting shadows and composition.', '2004-12-15 23:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065111, 127650, 19810, '<td valign="top">Good title .... a new untapped energy source!</td>', 'Good title .... a new untapped energy source!', '2004-12-15 23:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065113, 128232, 18799, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  The highlights are a little blown out, and the compositon isn''t very interesting though.  There are too many distracting elements in the background.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  The highlights are a little blown out, and the compositon isn''t very interesting though.  There are too many distracting elements in the background.', '2004-12-15 23:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065114, 128126, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good work.  Composition is nice, colors are pleasing and the flame shows the wind effect.  8</td>', 'Good work.  Composition is nice, colors are pleasing and the flame shows the wind effect.  8', '2004-12-15 23:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065115, 128174, 19810, '<td valign="top">Hah!  Good one....</td>', 'Hah!  Good one....', '2004-12-15 23:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065116, 128305, 29777, '<td valign="top">How did you get this? She is so sharp compared to the rest of the image.</td>', 'How did you get this? She is so sharp compared to the rest of the image.', '2004-12-15 23:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065118, 127942, 18799, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge.  For me, the candle should have been in better focus, and the flame is overexposed.</td>', 'Meets the challenge.  For me, the candle should have been in better focus, and the flame is overexposed.', '2004-12-15 23:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065121, 128392, 19810, '<td valign="top">Good time exposure during what looks like it might have been a bright day -- use any filters to stop down a bit??</td>', 'Good time exposure during what looks like it might have been a bright day -- use any filters to stop down a bit??', '2004-12-15 23:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065125, 128180, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am giving this entry a 5 while my average vote is a 6.  My reason has nothing to do with the subject matter.  I think the focus needs improvement and the stark white background is unnatural and distracting.  I do like the composition/placement of the flag in the frame.  Good luck.</td>', 'I am giving this entry a 5 while my average vote is a 6.  My reason has nothing to do with the subject matter.  I think the focus needs improvement and the stark white background is unnatural and distracting.  I do like the composition/placement of the flag in the frame.  Good luck.', '2004-12-15 23:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065127, 127732, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice job illustrating wind.  I think the whites are just a little overexposed, but still good.  8</td>', 'Nice job illustrating wind.  I think the whites are just a little overexposed, but still good.  8', '2004-12-15 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065129, 127892, 18799, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge with the bent over flame.  Problem: my eyes go right to the powerful border in this shot and have a hard time getting away from it.  As for the candle, the flame is overexposed - not an easy thing to shoot.</td>', 'Meets the challenge with the bent over flame.  Problem: my eyes go right to the powerful border in this shot and have a hard time getting away from it.  As for the candle, the flame is overexposed - not an easy thing to shoot.', '2004-12-15 23:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065130, 128369, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the anlge here but I think the composition would have been better if the entire flag had been inside the frame.  I am scoring this a 6 which is average on my scale.</td>', 'I like the anlge here but I think the composition would have been better if the entire flag had been inside the frame.  I am scoring this a 6 which is average on my scale.', '2004-12-15 23:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065133, 128410, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting and somewhat daring border here for a group that generally doesn''t seem to care much for borders (including myself) but I like this one for some reason.   I like the relation of the title to the drama of the subject too.   8</td>', 'Interesting and somewhat daring border here for a group that generally doesn''t seem to care much for borders (including myself) but I like this one for some reason.   I like the relation of the title to the drama of the subject too.   8', '2004-12-15 23:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065134, 127592, 25464, '<td valign="top">NIce contrast with the colors of the flag against the snowy background.  It was a good choice to go for trees in the background rather than the plain white snowy sky.  It is almost ironic that a leaf is depicted on the flag while none remain on the trees.  I am voting this one a 7. (6 is average on my scale.)</td>', 'NIce contrast with the colors of the flag against the snowy background.  It was a good choice to go for trees in the background rather than the plain white snowy sky.  It is almost ironic that a leaf is depicted on the flag while none remain on the trees.  I am voting this one a 7. (6 is average on my scale.)', '2004-12-15 23:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065135, 127922, 18799, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s a powerful little fan!</td>', 'Wow, that''s a powerful little fan!', '2004-12-15 23:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065136, 128174, 25464, '<td valign="top">Definitely a creative approach.  The scarf and stormy looking sky definitely add to the illusion of wind. Bumping up to an 8.</td>', 'Definitely a creative approach.  The scarf and stormy looking sky definitely add to the illusion of wind. Bumping up to an 8.', '2004-12-15 23:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065138, 127518, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped the image much tighter from the sides to get rid of some of the negative space.  At the same time, I would have liked to have seen just a little more of the flagpoles of the lower two flags.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped the image much tighter from the sides to get rid of some of the negative space.  At the same time, I would have liked to have seen just a little more of the flagpoles of the lower two flags.', '2004-12-16 00:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065142, 127003, 18799, '<td valign="top">Why is he the only one suffering the effects of the wind?  Nice touch with the inverted umbrella (even though noone else is carrying one).  I like the look of the spectator in ithe upper left.   The effort here is great.   9</td>', 'Why is he the only one suffering the effects of the wind?  Nice touch with the inverted umbrella (even though noone else is carrying one).  I like the look of the spectator in ithe upper left.   The effort here is great.   9', '2004-12-16 00:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065144, 128465, 25464, '<td valign="top">The focus is a little soft and the colors are a little flat.  The composition is very centered which makes it a little dull.  It meets the challenge well and is an overall good shot.  I give it a 6 on my scale where 6 is average.</td>', 'The focus is a little soft and the colors are a little flat.  The composition is very centered which makes it a little dull.  It meets the challenge well and is an overall good shot.  I give it a 6 on my scale where 6 is average.', '2004-12-16 00:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065145, 128175, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think a vertical photo would have worked better for me.</td>', 'I think a vertical photo would have worked better for me.', '2004-12-16 00:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065148, 128461, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good job capturing the movement of the wind.  9</td>', 'Good job capturing the movement of the wind.  9', '2004-12-16 00:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065149, 128375, 18799, '<td valign="top">It looks like this tornado was very selective</td>', 'It looks like this tornado was very selective', '2004-12-16 00:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065151, 128391, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice catch</td>', 'Nice catch', '2004-12-16 00:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065152, 127628, 25464, '<td valign="top">This one depicts the wind, but the stark white background and soft focus are too distracting. 4.</td>', 'This one depicts the wind, but the stark white background and soft focus are too distracting. 4.', '2004-12-16 00:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065153, 128487, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great use of color to meet the challenge</td>', 'Great use of color to meet the challenge', '2004-12-16 00:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065154, 128435, 28679, '<td valign="top">Well taken snap</td>', 'Well taken snap', '2004-12-16 00:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065157, 128415, 18799, '<td valign="top">Other than the title, nothing about this photo says wind to me.</td>', 'Other than the title, nothing about this photo says wind to me.', '2004-12-16 00:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065158, 128433, 25464, '<td valign="top">A different take on the obvious; however, it is too distorted in my opinion.  4.</td>', 'A different take on the obvious; however, it is too distorted in my opinion.  4.', '2004-12-16 00:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065159, 128337, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like the swirling look the the sand (or whatever it is).  The flash on the hand gives it a ghostly look that I don''t care much for.</td>', 'I like the swirling look the the sand (or whatever it is).  The flash on the hand gives it a ghostly look that I don''t care much for.', '2004-12-16 00:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065160, 128208, 25464, '<td valign="top">Definitely depicts the wind, but the soft focus and low light are too distracting. 4.</td>', 'Definitely depicts the wind, but the soft focus and low light are too distracting. 4.', '2004-12-16 00:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065164, 128249, 25464, '<td valign="top">The flag is a subject that does not translate well to black and white in my opinion.  I like this choice of composition.  Interesting angle for the flag pole to enter the frame.  I am not a fan of the soft focus/extended exposure. 5.</td>', 'The flag is a subject that does not translate well to black and white in my opinion.  I like this choice of composition.  Interesting angle for the flag pole to enter the frame.  I am not a fan of the soft focus/extended exposure. 5.', '2004-12-16 00:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065165, 127518, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better taken as portrait rather than landscape.  The lower flags are too close to the edge of the frame.  Color and focus are good. 5.</td>', 'I think this would have been better taken as portrait rather than landscape.  The lower flags are too close to the edge of the frame.  Color and focus are good. 5.', '2004-12-16 00:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065166, 127490, 29777, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2004-12-16 00:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065167, 127453, 25464, '<td valign="top">Composition is interesting but seems a bit crowded in the frame.  Color and focus are nice. 5.</td>', 'Composition is interesting but seems a bit crowded in the frame.  Color and focus are nice. 5.', '2004-12-16 00:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065168, 127565, 18799, '<td valign="top">I never would have thought of this type of instrument and wind.  Good job.  My only problem is with the harsh flash that make him have kind of a ghostly look.  Maybe exposing for the background and turning the flash power down would have given more depth to the image (maybe your cameraa can''t do that)  6</td>', 'I never would have thought of this type of instrument and wind.  Good job.  My only problem is with the harsh flash that make him have kind of a ghostly look.  Maybe exposing for the background and turning the flash power down would have given more depth to the image (maybe your cameraa can''t do that)  6', '2004-12-16 00:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065170, 127680, 25464, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the soft focus for a flag. 4.</td>', 'Not a fan of the soft focus for a flag. 4.', '2004-12-16 00:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065171, 128421, 29777, '<td valign="top">funny. I like the reflection.</td>', 'funny. I like the reflection.', '2004-12-16 00:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065172, 128304, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this is too close to a wall or something.  The reflection and the dark spot in the upper left are distractions.</td>', 'I think this is too close to a wall or something.  The reflection and the dark spot in the upper left are distractions.', '2004-12-16 00:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065175, 128076, 29777, '<td valign="top">Good job. I couldn''t think of a good way to interpret the challenge this way.</td>', 'Good job. I couldn''t think of a good way to interpret the challenge this way.', '2004-12-16 00:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065176, 128444, 25464, '<td valign="top">This angle definitely had potential.  The color and focus are superb, but the spot lights on the flag pole ruin the shot.  I also get the political symbolism which is emotive without being offensive to anyone. bumping up to a 6.</td>', 'This angle definitely had potential.  The color and focus are superb, but the spot lights on the flag pole ruin the shot.  I also get the political symbolism which is emotive without being offensive to anyone. bumping up to a 6.', '2004-12-16 00:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065179, 127052, 18799, '<td valign="top">bird, wind, diagonal compostion = good.  filename, title = not so good.  7 anyway ;)</td>', 'bird, wind, diagonal compostion = good.  filename, title = not so good.  7 anyway ;)', '2004-12-16 00:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065180, 128148, 25464, '<td valign="top">This one is just too small to judge effectively.</td>', 'This one is just too small to judge effectively.', '2004-12-16 00:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065181, 128149, 29777, '<td valign="top">Nice image. The stuff in the lower right seems out of place.</td>', 'Nice image. The stuff in the lower right seems out of place.', '2004-12-16 00:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065183, 128429, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good job of capturing the movement of the flags.  I would have liked an angle that doesn''t show the text however.</td>', 'Good job of capturing the movement of the flags.  I would have liked an angle that doesn''t show the text however.', '2004-12-16 00:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
