(1065211, 127907, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the warmth conveyed by this shot.  Very calming.  Soft focus is appropriate.  Nice job 8.</td>', 'I like the warmth conveyed by this shot.  Very calming.  Soft focus is appropriate.  Nice job 8.', '2004-12-16 00:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065212, 128416, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed landscape shot.  Fits the challenge, and technically very good. 9.</td>', 'Nicely composed landscape shot.  Fits the challenge, and technically very good. 9.', '2004-12-16 00:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065213, 127778, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  There are some distracting white spots all over your image.  Not sure what is up with that, but very nice lines and expression. 8.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  There are some distracting white spots all over your image.  Not sure what is up with that, but very nice lines and expression. 8.', '2004-12-16 00:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065214, 128013, 25464, '<td valign="top">Color is great.  Definitely meets the challenge.  Maybe a bit oversharpened, and no WOW factor for me. 8.</td>', 'Color is great.  Definitely meets the challenge.  Maybe a bit oversharpened, and no WOW factor for me. 8.', '2004-12-16 00:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065215, 128489, 25464, '<td valign="top">My only complaint about this shot is the choice of BW verses color.  I, of course, don''t know what the color shot looked like, but this subject just seems more appropriate for color.  Judging from the direct shadow, I am guessing the sky might have been too blown out at this time of day.  The composition and choice of subject are great. 8.</td>', 'My only complaint about this shot is the choice of BW verses color.  I, of course, don''t know what the color shot looked like, but this subject just seems more appropriate for color.  Judging from the direct shadow, I am guessing the sky might have been too blown out at this time of day.  The composition and choice of subject are great. 8.', '2004-12-16 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065217, 128491, 25464, '<td valign="top">The subject here is a little on the boring side, but I love the color, texture, and treatment on this shot. 8.</td>', 'The subject here is a little on the boring side, but I love the color, texture, and treatment on this shot. 8.', '2004-12-16 00:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065218, 128350, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this one is great for this challenge.  Well taken. bumping up to a 9.</td>', 'I think this one is great for this challenge.  Well taken. bumping up to a 9.', '2004-12-16 00:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065220, 128047, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Nice vintage look. 9.</td>', 'Very well done.  Nice vintage look. 9.', '2004-12-16 01:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065221, 127921, 25464, '<td valign="top">Contrast is a bit off, water runs into sky with no real definition.   I don''t like the top of the sail leaving the frame.  Otherwise a very well done shot and a good choice of subject for the challenge. 7.</td>', 'Contrast is a bit off, water runs into sky with no real definition.   I don''t like the top of the sail leaving the frame.  Otherwise a very well done shot and a good choice of subject for the challenge. 7.', '2004-12-16 01:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065222, 128035, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines created by this shot.  Very well composed, and nicely executed.  I would have like to have seen the color bumped up just a bit.  Bumping up the score to 8.</td>', 'I really like the lines created by this shot.  Very well composed, and nicely executed.  I would have like to have seen the color bumped up just a bit.  Bumping up the score to 8.', '2004-12-16 01:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065233, 128436, 28141, '<td valign="top">I''m not big on square crops</td>', 'I''m not big on square crops', '2004-12-16 01:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065234, 128350, 28141, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, though I''m not crazy about sqaure crops.</td>', 'I like the colors, though I''m not crazy about sqaure crops.', '2004-12-16 01:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065237, 128478, 28141, '<td valign="top">A little dark...emphasizes the sky more than the blown grass.</td>', 'A little dark...emphasizes the sky more than the blown grass.', '2004-12-16 01:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065238, 127907, 28141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.  I''d like to see the dark grasses less centered, perhaps by trimming the left hand side a bit.  I think that would make it more dynamic.</td>', 'Beautiful color.  I''d like to see the dark grasses less centered, perhaps by trimming the left hand side a bit.  I think that would make it more dynamic.', '2004-12-16 01:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065240, 128492, 28141, '<td valign="top">I''m not big on borders and this one is perticularly distracting.  The solid black of the border minimizes the impact of the blacks on the umbrella.</td>', 'I''m not big on borders and this one is perticularly distracting.  The solid black of the border minimizes the impact of the blacks on the umbrella.', '2004-12-16 01:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065241, 127743, 28141, '<td valign="top">Seems a little out of focus, but I like the idea.</td>', 'Seems a little out of focus, but I like the idea.', '2004-12-16 01:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065242, 127849, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2004-12-16 01:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065243, 127052, 28141, '<td valign="top">Having the bird uncentered would make it more dynamic.</td>', 'Having the bird uncentered would make it more dynamic.', '2004-12-16 01:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065246, 128244, 17877, '<td valign="top">this really is an incredible shot</td>', 'this really is an incredible shot', '2004-12-16 01:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065247, 126934, 16241, '<td valign="top">wind?</td>', 'wind?', '2004-12-16 01:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065248, 127003, 17877, '<td valign="top">artificially interesting</td>', 'artificially interesting', '2004-12-16 01:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065249, 128400, 28141, '<td valign="top">Wind?</td>', 'Wind?', '2004-12-16 01:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065250, 128426, 28141, '<td valign="top">Are Northern Lights wind related?  I thought they had to do with solar flares...</td>', 'Are Northern Lights wind related?  I thought they had to do with solar flares...', '2004-12-16 01:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065251, 128399, 28141, '<td valign="top">The border is distracting and not necessary.  Otherwise I like this shot a lot.</td>', 'The border is distracting and not necessary.  Otherwise I like this shot a lot.', '2004-12-16 01:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065252, 127397, 28141, '<td valign="top">The wind sock is so small...a tighter shot would have been better.  The cones (or whatever those are) are interesting, but if the windsock is your primary subject, they are distracting.</td>', 'The wind sock is so small...a tighter shot would have been better.  The cones (or whatever those are) are interesting, but if the windsock is your primary subject, they are distracting.', '2004-12-16 01:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065253, 127472, 28141, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look very windy...</td>', 'Doesn''t look very windy...', '2004-12-16 01:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065254, 128013, 16241, '<td valign="top">thats refreshing!</td>', 'thats refreshing!', '2004-12-16 01:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065258, 127849, 13749, '<td valign="top">great depth, but i have trouble finding a place to focus my eyes/interest</td>', 'great depth, but i have trouble finding a place to focus my eyes/interest', '2004-12-16 02:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
