(1065359, 127907, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing to the eye with nice warm tones. One of the better grass shots I''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'Very pleasing to the eye with nice warm tones. One of the better grass shots I''ve seen in this challenge.', '2004-12-16 06:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065362, 128480, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great composition and DOF. Wonderfully executed photo! As a sidenote, this image stimulates my sense of sound more than it does the sense of touch.</td>', 'Great composition and DOF. Wonderfully executed photo! As a sidenote, this image stimulates my sense of sound more than it does the sense of touch.', '2004-12-16 06:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065364, 128125, 14656, '<td valign="top">Seeing as how you wanted the flag as your focal point, it would''ve been nicer if it were placed more towards the center of the frame. It is easily overlooked and I find the lamps to be of greater interest. Better composition would relieve some of this confusion.</td>', 'Seeing as how you wanted the flag as your focal point, it would''ve been nicer if it were placed more towards the center of the frame. It is easily overlooked and I find the lamps to be of greater interest. Better composition would relieve some of this confusion.', '2004-12-16 06:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065368, 128375, 14656, '<td valign="top">Wowsers. That unnatural blue sky is what first caught my eye as the image loaded from top to bottom. I find it very distracting and out of place in your photo. The sheer intensity and brightness of the color doesn''t mesh well with the warm, earthy tones of the rest of the picture. Mentally eliminating that portion of your image (and scrolling down), the rest of the composition is very busy and chaotic. A tighter crop would''ve been beneficial.</td>', 'Wowsers. That unnatural blue sky is what first caught my eye as the image loaded from top to bottom. I find it very distracting and out of place in your photo. The sheer intensity and brightness of the color doesn''t mesh well with the warm, earthy tones of the rest of the picture. Mentally eliminating that portion of your image (and scrolling down), the rest of the composition is very busy and chaotic. A tighter crop would''ve been beneficial.', '2004-12-16 06:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065371, 126980, 14656, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop would''ve been useful in emphasizing the wind through the hair. The lower 3/4ths of the image steal focus away from the challenge theme.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop would''ve been useful in emphasizing the wind through the hair. The lower 3/4ths of the image steal focus away from the challenge theme.', '2004-12-16 06:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065372, 128398, 29132, '<td valign="top">I give this one a 10. I can almost "see" the wind in the empty space to the left. The lighting from the left works well as does the cropping to the right. This is the first time a DPC photographer has used a border that I felt enhanced the photo rather than distracting ifrom t. The simple solid line is aesthetically pleasing. I just can''t say enough about this photo. It shows real thinking outside the box and sets a new standard -- for this challenge and DPC in general. Thank you!</td>', 'I give this one a 10. I can almost "see" the wind in the empty space to the left. The lighting from the left works well as does the cropping to the right. This is the first time a DPC photographer has used a border that I felt enhanced the photo rather than distracting ifrom t. The simple solid line is aesthetically pleasing. I just can''t say enough about this photo. It shows real thinking outside the box and sets a new standard -- for this challenge and DPC in general. Thank you!', '2004-12-16 06:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065373, 128234, 29132, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Nice perspective. The angle of the sun works well. An 8.</td>', 'Pretty. Nice perspective. The angle of the sun works well. An 8.', '2004-12-16 06:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065374, 128126, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of composition. Most would have centered the candle. Nice to see someone thinking differently.</td>', 'Interesting choice of composition. Most would have centered the candle. Nice to see someone thinking differently.', '2004-12-16 06:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065377, 128196, 14656, '<td valign="top">Clever title, good DOF, nice capture.</td>', 'Clever title, good DOF, nice capture.', '2004-12-16 06:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065380, 128484, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting atmospheric conditions. I''m a bit put off by the extremely literal title. Having a more ambiguous title would leave more creativity on the viewer''s part and leave your photo up to personal interpretation. Spelling it out for us takes away some of the mystery.</td>', 'Interesting atmospheric conditions. I''m a bit put off by the extremely literal title. Having a more ambiguous title would leave more creativity on the viewer''s part and leave your photo up to personal interpretation. Spelling it out for us takes away some of the mystery.', '2004-12-16 06:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065382, 127397, 29132, '<td valign="top">The wind sock is a great idea for a subject -- I just find it too small in this photo -- overwhelmed by the foreground which is considerably less interesting. Could be improved if we saw more of a runway, or an airplane. Otherwise, a tighter shot of the sock would be an improvement -- perhaps looking up towards the sky since the clouds in this photo are far more inspiring than the ground in this particular setting.</td>', 'The wind sock is a great idea for a subject -- I just find it too small in this photo -- overwhelmed by the foreground which is considerably less interesting. Could be improved if we saw more of a runway, or an airplane. Otherwise, a tighter shot of the sock would be an improvement -- perhaps looking up towards the sky since the clouds in this photo are far more inspiring than the ground in this particular setting.', '2004-12-16 06:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065383, 128189, 30364, '<td valign="top">No wind + ? = 2</td>', 'No wind + ? = 2', '2004-12-16 06:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065384, 127968, 14656, '<td valign="top">Crop is a little tight but acceptable. Nice colors.</td>', 'Crop is a little tight but acceptable. Nice colors.', '2004-12-16 06:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065385, 128451, 29132, '<td valign="top">Nice -- great colors and lighting. A 9.</td>', 'Nice -- great colors and lighting. A 9.', '2004-12-16 06:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065386, 128322, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice to see someone thinking outside of the box. I was about to submit a similar entry myself. Honorable mention and bonus points for creativity!</td>', 'Nice to see someone thinking outside of the box. I was about to submit a similar entry myself. Honorable mention and bonus points for creativity!', '2004-12-16 06:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065387, 127763, 14656, '<td valign="top">What is that person doing in the bottom left of the frame? Was it essential to the photo that he be positioned there or in the frame at all?</td>', 'What is that person doing in the bottom left of the frame? Was it essential to the photo that he be positioned there or in the frame at all?', '2004-12-16 06:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065388, 127052, 29132, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird. Nice photo. Just wish it were named by you instead of your computer: "IMG_0741-2.jpg." This one gets a 7.</td>', 'Beautiful bird. Nice photo. Just wish it were named by you instead of your computer: "IMG_0741-2.jpg." This one gets a 7.', '2004-12-16 06:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065389, 127556, 14656, '<td valign="top">A bit abstract and hard to decipher. Unfortunately, I don''t think this shot will score very high....... I still can''t figure out what it is.</td>', 'A bit abstract and hard to decipher. Unfortunately, I don''t think this shot will score very high....... I still can''t figure out what it is.', '2004-12-16 06:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065392, 128131, 14656, '<td valign="top">Crop is a bit tight. Seems like the spool is your focal point but I''d think you''d at least want the entire crank in the frame. The background and harsh shadow cast upon it does nothing for this photo.</td>', 'Crop is a bit tight. Seems like the spool is your focal point but I''d think you''d at least want the entire crank in the frame. The background and harsh shadow cast upon it does nothing for this photo.', '2004-12-16 06:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065393, 128047, 29132, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this photo works well. Great framing and cropping. Perfect in black and white. This one gets a 9.</td>', 'The simplicity of this photo works well. Great framing and cropping. Perfect in black and white. This one gets a 9.', '2004-12-16 07:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
