(1065395, 128370, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture! Looks like a great place to go diving. I could see myself laying there for hours, tanning to a crisp.</td>', 'Beautiful capture! Looks like a great place to go diving. I could see myself laying there for hours, tanning to a crisp.', '2004-12-16 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065396, 128078, 30364, '<td valign="top">Me too.  1.</td>', 'Me too.  1.', '2004-12-16 07:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065398, 128348, 29132, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... This photo actually has a lot of potential, but the uninspiring background detracts from your subject. The creases in the background are distracting. It would work better if the background were either solid (as in a studio) or if we saw more of this candles''s surroundings. The smoke from the candle is an excellent visual illustration of wind. I give this one a 7 -- for concept, if not execution.</td>', 'Hmmm... This photo actually has a lot of potential, but the uninspiring background detracts from your subject. The creases in the background are distracting. It would work better if the background were either solid (as in a studio) or if we saw more of this candles''s surroundings. The smoke from the candle is an excellent visual illustration of wind. I give this one a 7 -- for concept, if not execution.', '2004-12-16 07:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065399, 127757, 29132, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous and mysterious image that illustrates wind in the most delicate and subtle way -- a 9.</td>', 'A gorgeous and mysterious image that illustrates wind in the most delicate and subtle way -- a 9.', '2004-12-16 07:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065403, 128452, 29132, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo with a lot of potential. The head on shot of the sun is too harsh -- looks more like a nuclear explosion than dawn. But the reflection on the water it creates and the silhouette of the man work well. So, I think your angle is right on. I''d just like to see more of the silhouetted man against the sparkling water -- and keep the sun as your light source -- not your subject. I give this photo a 7.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo with a lot of potential. The head on shot of the sun is too harsh -- looks more like a nuclear explosion than dawn. But the reflection on the water it creates and the silhouette of the man work well. So, I think your angle is right on. I''d just like to see more of the silhouetted man against the sparkling water -- and keep the sun as your light source -- not your subject. I give this photo a 7.', '2004-12-16 07:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065405, 128431, 30364, '<td valign="top">Hardly any points.  2.</td>', 'Hardly any points.  2.', '2004-12-16 07:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065406, 128013, 29132, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous contrast of colors -- a 9.</td>', 'A gorgeous contrast of colors -- a 9.', '2004-12-16 07:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065407, 128115, 29132, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the subject. Simple. Concise. My vote: 9.</td>', 'Nice placement of the subject. Simple. Concise. My vote: 9.', '2004-12-16 07:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065410, 128141, 29132, '<td valign="top">This photo has potential, but is either too close or too wide. I would prefer to see either a wider shot with the kite in it, or -- even better -- a closer shot of the family to see their facial features and expressions. This one gets a 6 1/2 -- so I''m rounding up to 7.</td>', 'This photo has potential, but is either too close or too wide. I would prefer to see either a wider shot with the kite in it, or -- even better -- a closer shot of the family to see their facial features and expressions. This one gets a 6 1/2 -- so I''m rounding up to 7.', '2004-12-16 07:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065411, 128304, 30364, '<td valign="top">Candle on its side.</td>', 'Candle on its side.', '2004-12-16 07:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065412, 128403, 29132, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit washed out and don''t like the cropped out reindeer on the upper left. But the title of this photo is hilarious and made me laugh out loud -- a 7.</td>', 'The colors seem a bit washed out and don''t like the cropped out reindeer on the upper left. But the title of this photo is hilarious and made me laugh out loud -- a 7.', '2004-12-16 07:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065413, 128432, 29132, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. A slightly larger file size for better viewing would have made the difference between a 7 and a 9 for me -- a 7.</td>', 'Pretty shot. A slightly larger file size for better viewing would have made the difference between a 7 and a 9 for me -- a 7.', '2004-12-16 07:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1065415, 128493, 29132, '<td valign="top">Nothing like the expression of a dog with wind blowing in the face -- a 9.</td>', 'Nothing like the expression of a dog with wind blowing in the face -- a 9.', '2004-12-16 07:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
