(1066063, 127344, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. It clearly shows the effect of wind. But the jpeg artifacts really kill your submission. You compressed it too heavily. Check out the forums and the tutorials on how to save pictures for the web.</td>', 'Nice picture. It clearly shows the effect of wind. But the jpeg artifacts really kill your submission. You compressed it too heavily. Check out the forums and the tutorials on how to save pictures for the web.', '2004-12-16 15:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
