(1066072, 127807, 27845, '<td valign="top">Did you think of the way buddhists pray when you took this picture? They write prayers on peaces of fabric. Each time the ribbon flaps, a prayer is sent to buddha.</td>', 'Did you think of the way buddhists pray when you took this picture? They write prayers on peaces of fabric. Each time the ribbon flaps, a prayer is sent to buddha.', '2004-12-16 16:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066078, 128131, 27845, '<td valign="top">Funny. I see you understand how to move in the challenge''s grey area. You should have used another light source. The direct flash creates shadows hich are to hard, and aggressive highlights. Also, you might have taken water as background. I hope this helps.</td>', 'Funny. I see you understand how to move in the challenge''s grey area. You should have used another light source. The direct flash creates shadows hich are to hard, and aggressive highlights. Also, you might have taken water as background. I hope this helps.', '2004-12-16 16:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066081, 127052, 27845, '<td valign="top">Such a lame title for such a beautiful picture! Didn''t you notice your forgot to give it a name? That happens sometimes, many photographers submit their picture within the last minute. A nice title would have been ''Gliding Grace''. The crop is good, the focus is on the bird, the water surface frames it and its green aspect makes a nice contrast against the blueish feathers. Nice shot.</td>', 'Such a lame title for such a beautiful picture! Didn''t you notice your forgot to give it a name? That happens sometimes, many photographers submit their picture within the last minute. A nice title would have been ''Gliding Grace''. The crop is good, the focus is on the bird, the water surface frames it and its green aspect makes a nice contrast against the blueish feathers. Nice shot.', '2004-12-16 16:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066103, 128047, 7291, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like this one very much.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like this one very much.', '2004-12-16 16:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066107, 128078, 7291, '<td valign="top">I imagine that your intent was to show that the wind has blown the leaves off of the tree?  If that''s the case then I don''t think many people will catch it.  The tree bark is also a strange shade of grey.  It gives the picture a an usual feel to it.</td>', 'I imagine that your intent was to show that the wind has blown the leaves off of the tree?  If that''s the case then I don''t think many people will catch it.  The tree bark is also a strange shade of grey.  It gives the picture a an usual feel to it.', '2004-12-16 16:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
