(1066299, 127645, 22046, '<td valign="top">This one grew on me the more I looked at it. I like the symmetrical feeling of the two sides of the building with one board askew on each side and not the same board. I like the shadow of the balcony on the right giving it quite a different look from the balcony on the left. I like the colors and tones. Excellent photo.</td>', 'This one grew on me the more I looked at it. I like the symmetrical feeling of the two sides of the building with one board askew on each side and not the same board. I like the shadow of the balcony on the right giving it quite a different look from the balcony on the left. I like the colors and tones. Excellent photo.', '2004-12-16 18:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
