(1066497, 128433, 27842, '<td valign="top">This has a nice abstract quality and even the noise adds to it appeal.  I know flags (especially US) are very taboo here, but I like this one purely on its artistic merit.</td>', 'This has a nice abstract quality and even the noise adds to it appeal.  I know flags (especially US) are very taboo here, but I like this one purely on its artistic merit.', '2004-12-16 22:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
