(1066732, 127797, 23478, '<td valign="top">You know, this is soooo close to just being really awesome.  The thing that is lacking is the focus.  Either using a tripod or better lighting or faster shutter speed would have just push this up.  The idea is great, it is easy to relate to, and the color is good.  Well done. 8.</td>', 'You know, this is soooo close to just being really awesome.  The thing that is lacking is the focus.  Either using a tripod or better lighting or faster shutter speed would have just push this up.  The idea is great, it is easy to relate to, and the color is good.  Well done. 8.', '2004-12-17 03:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066733, 128350, 24983, '<td valign="top">I like the coluors and the diagonal shape isolating against the sky was a good idea as well</td>', 'I like the coluors and the diagonal shape isolating against the sky was a good idea as well', '2004-12-17 03:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
