(1066779, 128073, 27845, '<td valign="top">The border is really really distracting and annoying. Otherwise it would have been a decent shot.</td>', 'The border is really really distracting and annoying. Otherwise it would have been a decent shot.', '2004-12-17 05:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066781, 128399, 27845, '<td valign="top">Dude, how did you do this? I''m eager for voting to end to hear you explanations on this one. Great shot. The idea of wind is clear and well analyzed. The composition is fine, but I don''t know what to think of the border. O well. 9.</td>', 'Dude, how did you do this? I''m eager for voting to end to hear you explanations on this one. Great shot. The idea of wind is clear and well analyzed. The composition is fine, but I don''t know what to think of the border. O well. 9.', '2004-12-17 05:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066784, 128398, 27845, '<td valign="top">Great. You made a very effective use of negative space. I usually don''t like semi-transparent borders but this one great. The nice soft lighting from the left emphasizes the half of the face which is oriented to the center of the picture. The title is a perfect match, too. Nothing annoying here. 10. Good job.<br/>Edit: Now that I''ve seen the other pics, I can say that I will eat a broomstick if you don''t get the blue ribbon. Good luck.</td>', 'Great. You made a very effective use of negative space. I usually don''t like semi-transparent borders but this one great. The nice soft lighting from the left emphasizes the half of the face which is oriented to the center of the picture. The title is a perfect match, too. Nothing annoying here. 10. Good job.Edit: Now that I''ve seen the other pics, I can say that I will eat a broomstick if you don''t get the blue ribbon. Good luck.', '2004-12-17 05:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066785, 128244, 27845, '<td valign="top">Awesome colours. These clouds look crazy. It seems the wind had some fun up there. Looks like a ribbon winner to me. 9.</td>', 'Awesome colours. These clouds look crazy. It seems the wind had some fun up there. Looks like a ribbon winner to me. 9.', '2004-12-17 05:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1066786, 127053, 27845, '<td valign="top">Looks crazy. I like that. The splash in the puddle looks great. I think that are mountains iin the background, but they look somehow like a huge wave approaching. The small border works well here.</td>', 'Looks crazy. I like that. The splash in the puddle looks great. I think that are mountains iin the background, but they look somehow like a huge wave approaching. The small border works well here.', '2004-12-17 05:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
