(1067531, 127344, 18374, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  This almost looks like a wave.  I like the abstract nature of it and the soft lighting.  It looks like there is a lot of digital noise (or jpeg compression artifacts) in the image- like it was blown up too large.   This is unfortunate because it greatly detracts from the image in my opinion.</td>', 'Hmmm.  This almost looks like a wave.  I like the abstract nature of it and the soft lighting.  It looks like there is a lot of digital noise (or jpeg compression artifacts) in the image- like it was blown up too large.   This is unfortunate because it greatly detracts from the image in my opinion.', '2004-12-17 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067545, 128141, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I like the wide open space and the contrast between the people and the land.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I like the wide open space and the contrast between the people and the land.  Nice job.', '2004-12-17 21:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067548, 128448, 18374, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color!  Very nice capture.</td>', 'Fantastic color!  Very nice capture.', '2004-12-17 21:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067552, 126957, 18374, '<td valign="top">This image does capture wind, but I think an alternative approach to the subject might yield a more interesting result.  The dull concrete, snow and ice don''t make for a very photogenic background for this image.  The glare coming off the ice in the upper left is a bit of a distraction.  The static pose of the subject also leaves something to be desired.  Perhaps showing the person struggling to walk against the wind with a cloudy sky or wind whipped tree in the background would add some emotion to the photo and help draw the viewer in.  A shallow depth of field to blur the background if there isn''t an interesting alternative might also be a good approach.</td>', 'This image does capture wind, but I think an alternative approach to the subject might yield a more interesting result.  The dull concrete, snow and ice don''t make for a very photogenic background for this image.  The glare coming off the ice in the upper left is a bit of a distraction.  The static pose of the subject also leaves something to be desired.  Perhaps showing the person struggling to walk against the wind with a cloudy sky or wind whipped tree in the background would add some emotion to the photo and help draw the viewer in.  A shallow depth of field to blur the background if there isn''t an interesting alternative might also be a good approach.', '2004-12-17 21:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067559, 127963, 18374, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting arrangement, but I am not sure what it is trying to show or convey.  Maybe it is just a composition of interesting objects and I am not supposed to find a deeper meaning.  I feel like I am missing something, though- like the candles, flute and head have some signifcance but I can''t spot it.  This photo does have impact, so kudos for that, but for me the impact is a kind of weird feeling!  If that was your intention, then I''d say you achieved it.</td>', 'This is an interesting arrangement, but I am not sure what it is trying to show or convey.  Maybe it is just a composition of interesting objects and I am not supposed to find a deeper meaning.  I feel like I am missing something, though- like the candles, flute and head have some signifcance but I can''t spot it.  This photo does have impact, so kudos for that, but for me the impact is a kind of weird feeling!  If that was your intention, then I''d say you achieved it.', '2004-12-17 22:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067561, 128076, 27593, '<td valign="top">Bravo, the only broken wind shot.</td>', 'Bravo, the only broken wind shot.', '2004-12-17 22:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067564, 127797, 18374, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like the capture of the smoke and the lighting, except that the white balance looks off.  The smoke has a yellowish tint to it instead of white.  Perhaps setting the camera to a tungsten white balance (if that is what was used to light this shot) would yield truer colors.</td>', 'Interesting.  I like the capture of the smoke and the lighting, except that the white balance looks off.  The smoke has a yellowish tint to it instead of white.  Perhaps setting the camera to a tungsten white balance (if that is what was used to light this shot) would yield truer colors.', '2004-12-17 22:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067570, 128492, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very crisp.  An interesting shot.  It is an image of contrasts that makes me think- Why is this guy carrying a girly looking zebra umbrella?  Ok, so a zebra umbrella isn''t necessarily girly, but since it isn''t raining this must be a parasol, not an umbrella and that definitely makes it girly!  :)  This is a fun shot.  Thank you!</td>', 'Very crisp.  An interesting shot.  It is an image of contrasts that makes me think- Why is this guy carrying a girly looking zebra umbrella?  Ok, so a zebra umbrella isn''t necessarily girly, but since it isn''t raining this must be a parasol, not an umbrella and that definitely makes it girly!  :)  This is a fun shot.  Thank you!', '2004-12-17 22:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067572, 128415, 18374, '<td valign="top">Where is the wind?  I would expect to see some trees moving or something to give the impression of wind.  I get the feeling of Winter and cold from this shot, but not wind.</td>', 'Where is the wind?  I would expect to see some trees moving or something to give the impression of wind.  I get the feeling of Winter and cold from this shot, but not wind.', '2004-12-17 22:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067588, 128338, 18374, '<td valign="top">That is a very neat tree.  I like the shape and textures on it.  Might I suggest a different framing/cropping of the image to either include the rear tree as a full element in the picture or eliminate it entirely to draw focus to the front tree?  As it is now, my attention is torn between the two elements like I am looking at two different pictures.</td>', 'That is a very neat tree.  I like the shape and textures on it.  Might I suggest a different framing/cropping of the image to either include the rear tree as a full element in the picture or eliminate it entirely to draw focus to the front tree?  As it is now, my attention is torn between the two elements like I am looking at two different pictures.', '2004-12-17 22:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067596, 128348, 18374, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great idea.  I have a few suggestions on how I think this photo might be improved.  First, I would make the background darker and/or blur it with a shallow DOF.  Second, the white balance looks like it wasn''t set correctly rendering the smoke, the skin and everything else yellow.  I''m guessing this was shot with tungsten lighting but the camera''s white balance setting was not changed to match.  Third, the writing on the shirt is distracting and should probably be cropped out.   I think some or all of these changes would result in a very striking photo.</td>', 'I think this is a great idea.  I have a few suggestions on how I think this photo might be improved.  First, I would make the background darker and/or blur it with a shallow DOF.  Second, the white balance looks like it wasn''t set correctly rendering the smoke, the skin and everything else yellow.  I''m guessing this was shot with tungsten lighting but the camera''s white balance setting was not changed to match.  Third, the writing on the shirt is distracting and should probably be cropped out.   I think some or all of these changes would result in a very striking photo.', '2004-12-17 22:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067599, 128491, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like the softness in the grass and clouds caused by the wind.  Good light, too.</td>', 'Very nice!  I like the softness in the grass and clouds caused by the wind.  Good light, too.', '2004-12-17 22:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067601, 128399, 18374, '<td valign="top">That is cool!  Interesting idea...</td>', 'That is cool!  Interesting idea...', '2004-12-17 22:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067607, 128115, 18374, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the candle shots (so far)  The white balance and color look more natural than most.  I like the deep black background as well.  Be careful, though- Nike might get you for a trademark violation!</td>', 'This is my favorite of the candle shots (so far)  The white balance and color look more natural than most.  I like the deep black background as well.  Be careful, though- Nike might get you for a trademark violation!', '2004-12-17 22:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067610, 128392, 23456, '<td valign="top">colours work well</td>', 'colours work well', '2004-12-17 22:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067611, 128035, 23456, '<td valign="top">nice shot, shame about the powerlines though :-)</td>', 'nice shot, shame about the powerlines though :-)', '2004-12-17 23:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067612, 128399, 23456, '<td valign="top">interesting shot</td>', 'interesting shot', '2004-12-17 23:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067617, 128244, 18374, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Interesting clouds.  Great color.  Very striking.</td>', 'Wow.  Interesting clouds.  Great color.  Very striking.', '2004-12-17 23:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067623, 127546, 18374, '<td valign="top">Incredible!  I almost believe the wind is doing this.  Is this really a wall that looks like a floor???</td>', 'Incredible!  I almost believe the wind is doing this.  Is this really a wall that looks like a floor???', '2004-12-17 23:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067632, 128410, 25397, '<td valign="top">The picture tilt works because it is in-sync with the wind. :)</td>', 'The picture tilt works because it is in-sync with the wind. :)', '2004-12-17 23:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067634, 128244, 25397, '<td valign="top">The colors and movement of the coulds are great. I also like how there is a bit of blue at the top showing the ''normal'' color of the sky. I would have liked to see a bit more of the cut-off horizon line.</td>', 'The colors and movement of the coulds are great. I also like how there is a bit of blue at the top showing the ''normal'' color of the sky. I would have liked to see a bit more of the cut-off horizon line.', '2004-12-17 23:41:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1067635, 128451, 25397, '<td valign="top">Wow this girl has really cool colored hair. Flames indeed.</td>', 'Wow this girl has really cool colored hair. Flames indeed.', '2004-12-17 23:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067643, 127922, 10208, '<td valign="top">Unique idea, high mark for imagination. I find the background colors a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Unique idea, high mark for imagination. I find the background colors a bit distracting though.', '2004-12-18 00:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067648, 127930, 10208, '<td valign="top">nice winter capture, and you can feel the cold breeze too</td>', 'nice winter capture, and you can feel the cold breeze too', '2004-12-18 00:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067650, 127723, 10208, '<td valign="top">good capture</td>', 'good capture', '2004-12-18 00:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067700, 128414, 25618, '<td valign="top">white balance seems a little off, but otherwise it would be a great picture.</td>', 'white balance seems a little off, but otherwise it would be a great picture.', '2004-12-18 02:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067701, 128432, 16648, '<td valign="top">too small. please do a search in teh forums or post a question on how to properly size/resize a pic for DPC entry.</td>', 'too small. please do a search in teh forums or post a question on how to properly size/resize a pic for DPC entry.', '2004-12-18 02:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067702, 126905, 16648, '<td valign="top">Wind...what is the connection to the river? Nice pic, but does not fit the challenge.</td>', 'Wind...what is the connection to the river? Nice pic, but does not fit the challenge.', '2004-12-18 02:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067703, 128454, 25618, '<td valign="top">nice photo just not real sure how this represents wind. I know its all in the eye of the beholder but to me it doesn''t represent the wind. Love the rays of light shining through the clouds though</td>', 'nice photo just not real sure how this represents wind. I know its all in the eye of the beholder but to me it doesn''t represent the wind. Love the rays of light shining through the clouds though', '2004-12-18 02:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067707, 128399, 16648, '<td valign="top">cool. the border is not a plus.</td>', 'cool. the border is not a plus.', '2004-12-18 02:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067708, 127083, 16648, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well, but is not a great composition...no appeal outside of the challenge.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well, but is not a great composition...no appeal outside of the challenge.', '2004-12-18 02:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067709, 127397, 16648, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the composition is bad - the item you want me to see is too small and a very isignificant part of the whole image. The reflective cones catch my eye, and lead me off to the right, not to the windsock. the horizontal white line (lights in motion?) cut the pic in 1/2. My eye wants to stay low.</td>', 'Good idea, but the composition is bad - the item you want me to see is too small and a very isignificant part of the whole image. The reflective cones catch my eye, and lead me off to the right, not to the windsock. the horizontal white line (lights in motion?) cut the pic in 1/2. My eye wants to stay low.', '2004-12-18 02:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067710, 127472, 16648, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, what wind? I see trees, I cannot see any wind, or moving trees or...very static.</td>', 'Hmmm, what wind? I see trees, I cannot see any wind, or moving trees or...very static.', '2004-12-18 02:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067711, 127003, 16648, '<td valign="top">He looks awsome, but the background is very cluttered and nobody else seems affected by teh gale force winds.</td>', 'He looks awsome, but the background is very cluttered and nobody else seems affected by teh gale force winds.', '2004-12-18 02:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067712, 128078, 16648, '<td valign="top">A bit small. I get no feeling of wind.</td>', 'A bit small. I get no feeling of wind.', '2004-12-18 02:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067713, 127665, 16648, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Not an interesting composition, and seems washed out, colorwise. No pun intended.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Not an interesting composition, and seems washed out, colorwise. No pun intended.', '2004-12-18 02:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067714, 128414, 16648, '<td valign="top">Why did you lighten it soooo much? Appears washed out. An attempt at some effect or feeling or an attempt to add interest to a non-interesting composition?</td>', 'Why did you lighten it soooo much? Appears washed out. An attempt at some effect or feeling or an attempt to add interest to a non-interesting composition?', '2004-12-18 02:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067716, 128337, 16648, '<td valign="top">Needs to be ashes from an urn of a cremated relative...as it is i meets the challenge, sort of, mbut lacks any interest beyond that.</td>', 'Needs to be ashes from an urn of a cremated relative...as it is i meets the challenge, sort of, mbut lacks any interest beyond that.', '2004-12-18 02:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067720, 128375, 16648, '<td valign="top">Beyond your family or insurance company, who will find this pic of interest? No attempt at an interesting composition, no item to focus on, just a snapshot of some broken trees. and a funny colored sky.</td>', 'Beyond your family or insurance company, who will find this pic of interest? No attempt at an interesting composition, no item to focus on, just a snapshot of some broken trees. and a funny colored sky.', '2004-12-18 02:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067722, 128173, 16648, '<td valign="top">The candle seems noisy/grainy and not in good focus. perhaps a more vertical crop would have been more appropriate.</td>', 'The candle seems noisy/grainy and not in good focus. perhaps a more vertical crop would have been more appropriate.', '2004-12-18 02:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067724, 127886, 16648, '<td valign="top">THe only connection i see to the challenge is the title. The image does not say wind to me.</td>', 'THe only connection i see to the challenge is the title. The image does not say wind to me.', '2004-12-18 02:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067727, 127963, 16648, '<td valign="top">Very interesting...she is a biit pale...makes me wonder why. off center adds interest. Daring pic...overall I have to give you a high score. Creative, well done.</td>', 'Very interesting...she is a biit pale...makes me wonder why. off center adds interest. Daring pic...overall I have to give you a high score. Creative, well done.', '2004-12-18 02:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067728, 128439, 16648, '<td valign="top">The bible quotation loses me completely. the image is very dark, hard to see what it is you are trying to say...</td>', 'The bible quotation loses me completely. the image is very dark, hard to see what it is you are trying to say...', '2004-12-18 02:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067729, 127650, 16648, '<td valign="top">The title is a bit much. Composition is decent. I''d like to see some movement in the turbine blades though - as it is the shot is a bit static.</td>', 'The title is a bit much. Composition is decent. I''d like to see some movement in the turbine blades though - as it is the shot is a bit static.', '2004-12-18 02:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067731, 128490, 16648, '<td valign="top">WAY too small. Please read up on how to properly resize an image for entry here. On the entry page you have an option to PREVIEW your entry - PLEASE do so.<br/> <br/>As for the image itself...i see a dark blurry pic of water. Too small to determine anything more, excpet perhaps that it lacks any idea of compostion.</td>', 'WAY too small. Please read up on how to properly resize an image for entry here. On the entry page you have an option to PREVIEW your entry - PLEASE do so. As for the image itself...i see a dark blurry pic of water. Too small to determine anything more, excpet perhaps that it lacks any idea of compostion.', '2004-12-18 02:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067732, 127490, 16648, '<td valign="top">Umm, how can i say this nicely...yuk. Not high key, but way overexposed - child looks to be wearing mime makeup or something. Whatever effect you were trying for did not succeed in my opinion.</td>', 'Umm, how can i say this nicely...yuk. Not high key, but way overexposed - child looks to be wearing mime makeup or something. Whatever effect you were trying for did not succeed in my opinion.', '2004-12-18 02:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067733, 128222, 4810, '<td valign="top">Just perfect.</td>', 'Just perfect.', '2004-12-18 02:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067734, 127962, 16648, '<td valign="top">Humor. Ha ha, i get it. Beyond that...the composition is bad, the pic is a bit noisy, the  colors are dull (lighting or underexposre or both, proper PP(post production) can fix that). The border detracts by drawing my eye too much. The wire in the sky is also a distraction.</td>', 'Humor. Ha ha, i get it. Beyond that...the composition is bad, the pic is a bit noisy, the  colors are dull (lighting or underexposre or both, proper PP(post production) can fix that). The border detracts by drawing my eye too much. The wire in the sky is also a distraction.', '2004-12-18 02:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067736, 128351, 16648, '<td valign="top">When i see a white feather floating, i think of the opening and closing shots of the movie Forrest Gump. This shot leaves a lot lacking...technically it might be fine. But the composition/crop lacks interest. the border would be better in white as the black has no connection to the image and darkens the already too dark 9to me) background.</td>', 'When i see a white feather floating, i think of the opening and closing shots of the movie Forrest Gump. This shot leaves a lot lacking...technically it might be fine. But the composition/crop lacks interest. the border would be better in white as the black has no connection to the image and darkens the already too dark 9to me) background.', '2004-12-18 02:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067739, 128388, 16648, '<td valign="top">Soo close, composition wise...more to your right and put the sale in line with teh high rises (to their left in the empty space in this pic) and you have something. What you have now is the sale getting lost in the buildings (in color and shape (vertical)) and the empty space is behind the boat...normally it is in front of the boat (car/plane/train/person walking). The pic seems a bit flat too - try USM 35%/60/1 and see if that helps make it ''pop'' a bit.</td>', 'Soo close, composition wise...more to your right and put the sale in line with teh high rises (to their left in the empty space in this pic) and you have something. What you have now is the sale getting lost in the buildings (in color and shape (vertical)) and the empty space is behind the boat...normally it is in front of the boat (car/plane/train/person walking). The pic seems a bit flat too - try USM 35%/60/1 and see if that helps make it ''pop'' a bit.', '2004-12-18 02:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067740, 127003, 20056, '<td valign="top">Funny! Did You install an air canyon? People in the background seems to be in a sunny day :)<br/>Very good picture anyway... one of my favourite at this moment!</td>', 'Funny! Did You install an air canyon? People in the background seems to be in a sunny day :)Very good picture anyway... one of my favourite at this moment!', '2004-12-18 02:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067742, 128141, 16648, '<td valign="top">A bit dark, noisy and i''d like to see the kite. The composition is off center..but not more than that. The only interesting part is how they are standing on the water. hallelujah, it''s another miracle!</td>', 'A bit dark, noisy and i''d like to see the kite. The composition is off center..but not more than that. The only interesting part is how they are standing on the water. hallelujah, it''s another miracle!', '2004-12-18 03:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067747, 128348, 16648, '<td valign="top">The backdrop is wrinkly. her glasses are reflecting something too bright - remove the glasses to remove a distracting element. Your white balance seeems off - or she has jaundice. The writing on the shirt is also a distraction - basic compositional rule: unless it adds to the picture''s meaning/intent, then it should not be there. The red shirt goes with the red candle, but the words? Perhaps a closer crop, lower the modle''s head a bit OR have her turn to face the camera at about a 45 degree angle...</td>', 'The backdrop is wrinkly. her glasses are reflecting something too bright - remove the glasses to remove a distracting element. Your white balance seeems off - or she has jaundice. The writing on the shirt is also a distraction - basic compositional rule: unless it adds to the picture''s meaning/intent, then it should not be there. The red shirt goes with the red candle, but the words? Perhaps a closer crop, lower the modle''s head a bit OR have her turn to face the camera at about a 45 degree angle...', '2004-12-18 03:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067749, 128073, 16648, '<td valign="top">nice border - ties into the pic nicely. the second flag pole is a distraction and needs to go. the shadow of it on the flag is bad too.</td>', 'nice border - ties into the pic nicely. the second flag pole is a distraction and needs to go. the shadow of it on the flag is bad too.', '2004-12-18 03:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067753, 128319, 20056, '<td valign="top">She looks sleepy rather than in the wind...</td>', 'She looks sleepy rather than in the wind...', '2004-12-18 03:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067754, 128196, 20056, '<td valign="top">nice effect but the blury sea-ligh does not work for me...t</td>', 'nice effect but the blury sea-ligh does not work for me...t', '2004-12-18 03:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067756, 128494, 20056, '<td valign="top">background is a little annoying for my eyes...</td>', 'background is a little annoying for my eyes...', '2004-12-18 03:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067757, 127053, 20056, '<td valign="top">a little dark and not enough windy :)</td>', 'a little dark and not enough windy :)', '2004-12-18 03:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067760, 128234, 20056, '<td valign="top">You capture the wind concept pretty well, just the light is too hard</td>', 'You capture the wind concept pretty well, just the light is too hard', '2004-12-18 03:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067763, 127986, 20056, '<td valign="top">Idea is very good, colors better but the result look a little forced for me... a 7</td>', 'Idea is very good, colors better but the result look a little forced for me... a 7', '2004-12-18 03:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067764, 127546, 20056, '<td valign="top">Do You work in Hollywood? :) Very good, maybe you could explain it.<br/>Did You thought in other background? I would have put the umbrella reversed... a 7</td>', 'Do You work in Hollywood? :) Very good, maybe you could explain it.Did You thought in other background? I would have put the umbrella reversed... a 7', '2004-12-18 03:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067765, 128311, 20056, '<td valign="top">This was also one my ideas but I did not get enough wind in my windows...</td>', 'This was also one my ideas but I did not get enough wind in my windows...', '2004-12-18 03:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067768, 127985, 14202, '<td valign="top">So many flapping "Glory", but I like this one as it is very crisp and great contrast with the vividness if the blue sky.</td>', 'So many flapping "Glory", but I like this one as it is very crisp and great contrast with the vividness if the blue sky.', '2004-12-18 03:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067769, 128215, 14202, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen the sky with more colour...very washed out/burnt.  But you have really gotten the concept of wind across with this shot.</td>', 'I would like to have seen the sky with more colour...very washed out/burnt.  But you have really gotten the concept of wind across with this shot.', '2004-12-18 03:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067771, 128464, 13749, '<td valign="top">all we are is dust in the wind?<br/>interesting interpretation - i do like it, but i''m afraid you''re going to get marked down on stretching it for the challenge (this is, of course, not wind).  anyhow, disregarding the challenge, nice shot (a lot of blown out highlights, but i guess it works for this style of photo)</td>', 'all we are is dust in the wind?interesting interpretation - i do like it, but i''m afraid you''re going to get marked down on stretching it for the challenge (this is, of course, not wind).  anyhow, disregarding the challenge, nice shot (a lot of blown out highlights, but i guess it works for this style of photo)', '2004-12-18 04:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067773, 128399, 14202, '<td valign="top">Very clever...Very simple and yet conveys the total concept of the challenge.  Well Done.</td>', 'Very clever...Very simple and yet conveys the total concept of the challenge.  Well Done.', '2004-12-18 04:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067774, 128193, 14202, '<td valign="top">Lots of candle flames in this challenge, but I feel this is one of the better ones.  IMHO maybe a bit burnt (no puin intended) at the flame but a very good shot none the less... Well done.</td>', 'Lots of candle flames in this challenge, but I feel this is one of the better ones.  IMHO maybe a bit burnt (no puin intended) at the flame but a very good shot none the less... Well done.', '2004-12-18 04:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067784, 126905, 23394, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4, this is a nice documentary shot, but not very compelling<br/>Technical: 5, nothing really wrong, nor really outstanding<br/>Appeal: 3, i might find this more interesting at a different time of day, with different lighting<br/>Challenge: 1, i see nothing related to wind<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 3</td>', 'Composition: 4, this is a nice documentary shot, but not very compellingTechnical: 5, nothing really wrong, nor really outstandingAppeal: 3, i might find this more interesting at a different time of day, with different lightingChallenge: 1, i see nothing related to windOverall Calculated Average Score: 3', '2004-12-18 05:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067785, 128490, 23394, '<td valign="top">better luck next time.  just don''t give up.  keep trying.  and really, really, take advantage of this site by looking at the images that win, and then trying to recreate them yourself.  it takes a lot of practice, but if you are interested in photography, it is worth it!</td>', 'better luck next time.  just don''t give up.  keep trying.  and really, really, take advantage of this site by looking at the images that win, and then trying to recreate them yourself.  it takes a lot of practice, but if you are interested in photography, it is worth it!', '2004-12-18 05:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1067788, 128431, 23394, '<td valign="top">maybe if you had shot this on a different day...<br/>if the smoke is the subject, the foreground is too cluttered.  if the plant is the subject, you have too much sky and smoke.  the lighting and colors are interesting.  the noise is a bit much (just a little neat image can go a long way).<br/>good luck.</td>', 'maybe if you had shot this on a different day...if the smoke is the subject, the foreground is too cluttered.  if the plant is the subject, you have too much sky and smoke.  the lighting and colors are interesting.  the noise is a bit much (just a little neat image can go a long way).good luck.', '2004-12-18 05:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
