(1067796, 128421, 23394, '<td valign="top">this image is a bit too busy, and not working too well for me.  the stop-motion aspect of your snapshot takes away from really catching the wind.  the toughest thing about challenge shooting is coming up with an idea and then executing it.  it really does take time and practice.  good luck!</td>', 'this image is a bit too busy, and not working too well for me.  the stop-motion aspect of your snapshot takes away from really catching the wind.  the toughest thing about challenge shooting is coming up with an idea and then executing it.  it really does take time and practice.  good luck!', '2004-12-18 05:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
