(1067914, 128425, 19959, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I thought that a wind tunnel shot would be a great picture. I stopped short because I don''t have access to one! (I didn''t even consider going down the model route!)<br/> <br/>While this is a good effort I find that the DOF is a little too shallow and gives the impression of poor focus on the car, also IMO it would have looked better in profile (in the classic wind-tunnel perspective!)</td>', 'Great idea. I thought that a wind tunnel shot would be a great picture. I stopped short because I don''t have access to one! (I didn''t even consider going down the model route!) While this is a good effort I find that the DOF is a little too shallow and gives the impression of poor focus on the car, also IMO it would have looked better in profile (in the classic wind-tunnel perspective!)', '2004-12-18 11:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
