(1068045, 128410, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like the actual photograph contained here.  Great use of lines and composition and backlighting.  Your centered subject works well with the lines leading to the lower right corner.  However, My eye is drawn more to the framing and immediately says ''Not centered.''  Call me old school, but if this were cropped more conventionally (with or without traditional frame) this would score slightly higher with this voter!<br/>TC</td>', 'I like the actual photograph contained here.  Great use of lines and composition and backlighting.  Your centered subject works well with the lines leading to the lower right corner.  However, My eye is drawn more to the framing and immediately says ''Not centered.''  Call me old school, but if this were cropped more conventionally (with or without traditional frame) this would score slightly higher with this voter!TC', '2004-12-18 14:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068047, 128338, 9906, '<td valign="top">I immediately thought, ''what are the conditions of this area that made these trees grow this way?  Cool compositon and use of DOF.  I WOULD like to see both of the trees in entirety though.  Maybe back up 5 or 10 feet?<br/>TC</td>', 'I immediately thought, ''what are the conditions of this area that made these trees grow this way?  Cool compositon and use of DOF.  I WOULD like to see both of the trees in entirety though.  Maybe back up 5 or 10 feet?TC', '2004-12-18 14:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
