(1068060, 128489, 6132, '<td valign="top">A perfect capture for the challenge. Good composition, love the tones.  It''s a shame about the buildings in the background but something that obviously can''t be helped too much. My fave for this challenge.</td>', 'A perfect capture for the challenge. Good composition, love the tones.  It''s a shame about the buildings in the background but something that obviously can''t be helped too much. My fave for this challenge.', '2004-12-18 14:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
