(1068559, 128436, 22384, '<td valign="top">Unique take and point-of-view. The elements conflict for me. The motif in the background, the air-filled tube and then the image on the right edge of your frame. My eye and mind cannot find an easy or interesting place to rest.</td>', 'Unique take and point-of-view. The elements conflict for me. The motif in the background, the air-filled tube and then the image on the right edge of your frame. My eye and mind cannot find an easy or interesting place to rest.', '2004-12-19 01:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068560, 127503, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and the leaning forward gives the illusion of wind. I would like to see the hat in perfect stop motion. An interesting framing would be much closer to your subject with the hat closer to his head. I feel this because only those two elements show wind. Everything else in this photo seems deathly still.</td>', 'Great idea, and the leaning forward gives the illusion of wind. I would like to see the hat in perfect stop motion. An interesting framing would be much closer to your subject with the hat closer to his head. I feel this because only those two elements show wind. Everything else in this photo seems deathly still.', '2004-12-19 01:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068581, 128392, 29111, '<td valign="top">Nice action. The contrast of yellow and blue is appealing</td>', 'Nice action. The contrast of yellow and blue is appealing', '2004-12-19 01:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068588, 128385, 29111, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, but the motion has been captured very nicely.</td>', 'A little grainy, but the motion has been captured very nicely.', '2004-12-19 01:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068593, 128234, 29111, '<td valign="top">Nice framing for a high-contrast shot. Slightly longer exposure might have been interesting too, but this does convey the topic.</td>', 'Nice framing for a high-contrast shot. Slightly longer exposure might have been interesting too, but this does convey the topic.', '2004-12-19 01:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068595, 127797, 29111, '<td valign="top">Great concept and dramatic colour. Focus could be a bit sharper though.</td>', 'Great concept and dramatic colour. Focus could be a bit sharper though.', '2004-12-19 01:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068601, 128412, 22384, '<td valign="top">This beautiful woman is the antithesis of those glossy fashion shots filled with bored-looking models. You have captured a sense of fun and joyfulness in her animated and sparkling expression. The wind in her hair enhances that joy and exuberance; therefore, the shot works very well for me. I would crop even tighter so that she fills the frame even more, especially down from the top. Let her own this picture. 8</td>', 'This beautiful woman is the antithesis of those glossy fashion shots filled with bored-looking models. You have captured a sense of fun and joyfulness in her animated and sparkling expression. The wind in her hair enhances that joy and exuberance; therefore, the shot works very well for me. I would crop even tighter so that she fills the frame even more, especially down from the top. Let her own this picture. 8', '2004-12-19 02:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068603, 128338, 22384, '<td valign="top">Wow! Yep, this works for me. Great shot. 8</td>', 'Wow! Yep, this works for me. Great shot. 8', '2004-12-19 02:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068607, 127907, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view. Great color and the blurred stocks show movement and wind very well. Nice shot. I tried something like this but failed miserably. 7</td>', 'Nice point of view. Great color and the blurred stocks show movement and wind very well. Nice shot. I tried something like this but failed miserably. 7', '2004-12-19 02:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068611, 128234, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The rock-steady stillness and crisp focus of the wooden frame really enhances the movement of the blades. Great point of view. Fascinating shot</td>', 'Great shot. The rock-steady stillness and crisp focus of the wooden frame really enhances the movement of the blades. Great point of view. Fascinating shot', '2004-12-19 02:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068613, 128143, 22384, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and expression on your subject''s face. I find the lighting distracting.</td>', 'Cute idea and expression on your subject''s face. I find the lighting distracting.', '2004-12-19 02:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068615, 127242, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is beaurtiful. Your ability to capture movement with such a crisp focus shows an artistic eye and a masterful touch. Really captivating. An easy 9</td>', 'This is beaurtiful. Your ability to capture movement with such a crisp focus shows an artistic eye and a masterful touch. Really captivating. An easy 9', '2004-12-19 02:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068620, 127522, 29111, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white shot, could do with a touch more contrast but the composition is good and makes a change from the other colour shots of the same subject for this competition</td>', 'Nice black and white shot, could do with a touch more contrast but the composition is good and makes a change from the other colour shots of the same subject for this competition', '2004-12-19 02:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068624, 128427, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot. I love the monochromatic look and the lighting. The blown out whites work so well in this shot. Brilliant, and the title and concept show courage and daring. Bravo for seeing this in a different way. 9</td>', 'Stunning shot. I love the monochromatic look and the lighting. The blown out whites work so well in this shot. Brilliant, and the title and concept show courage and daring. Bravo for seeing this in a different way. 9', '2004-12-19 02:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068626, 127849, 29111, '<td valign="top">Picture is rather blocky, watch which setting you use when you resize your photo, looks like you got caught with pixel resize.<br/>Compositionally there is a touch too much foreground. Try cropping it off about two thirds of the way down.</td>', 'Picture is rather blocky, watch which setting you use when you resize your photo, looks like you got caught with pixel resize.Compositionally there is a touch too much foreground. Try cropping it off about two thirds of the way down.', '2004-12-19 02:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068628, 128215, 29111, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the background is a bit distracting. Not sure how high this was, but maybe you could drape a sheet behind it to isolate the whirlybird.</td>', 'Good idea, but the background is a bit distracting. Not sure how high this was, but maybe you could drape a sheet behind it to isolate the whirlybird.', '2004-12-19 02:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068629, 128174, 22384, '<td valign="top">So funny. I love this shot. The choice to crop it like this adds to the visual humor, making your subject appear even smaller and more helpless.</td>', 'So funny. I love this shot. The choice to crop it like this adds to the visual humor, making your subject appear even smaller and more helpless.', '2004-12-19 02:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068631, 128189, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great image. I think the connection to "wind" is a little loose. However would have got a 9 from me for the yellow challenge. I love the drab colours of the background contrasted withe the main subject. The composition is excellent. The images gives me a feeling of desolation.</td>', 'Great image. I think the connection to "wind" is a little loose. However would have got a 9 from me for the yellow challenge. I love the drab colours of the background contrasted withe the main subject. The composition is excellent. The images gives me a feeling of desolation.', '2004-12-19 02:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068633, 128391, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great stop action shot.</td>', 'Great stop action shot.', '2004-12-19 02:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068635, 127490, 23300, '<td valign="top">Do you mean blown highlights or blown by the wind. I''m a sucker for a double meaning and I also love experimentation with overexposure. Your technique certainly creates a dramatic effect.</td>', 'Do you mean blown highlights or blown by the wind. I''m a sucker for a double meaning and I also love experimentation with overexposure. Your technique certainly creates a dramatic effect.', '2004-12-19 02:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068638, 127681, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. There''s also a grittiness about this image that is very appealing. Its one of those image that defies explaination to a certain degree yet makes its way straight into my favourites. Nice work. Good luck.</td>', 'I love the composition. There''s also a grittiness about this image that is very appealing. Its one of those image that defies explaination to a certain degree yet makes its way straight into my favourites. Nice work. Good luck.', '2004-12-19 02:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068649, 127490, 13749, '<td valign="top">blown in more ways than one (ie: out).    although i normally don''t like this, you seem to have done something interesting with it and it doesn''t necessarily work against you here - kind of creates a unique feel/look, but may have preferred just a <i>slightly</i> higher crop on the bottom since there isn''t much detail.</td>', 'blown in more ways than one (ie: out).    although i normally don''t like this, you seem to have done something interesting with it and it doesn''t necessarily work against you here - kind of creates a unique feel/look, but may have preferred just a slightly higher crop on the bottom since there isn''t much detail.', '2004-12-19 02:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068650, 128322, 29111, '<td valign="top">:-) Clever! Nice definition and lighting. I like the way you captured the motion of the second hand.</td>', ':-) Clever! Nice definition and lighting. I like the way you captured the motion of the second hand.', '2004-12-19 02:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068652, 128305, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and mood created by this image. The connection to the challenge theme is not really evident to me though. Having said that I do like the model''s pose and expression. The style of the image makes the model look a little bit alien in the environment which I think adds to the impact.</td>', 'I like the composition and mood created by this image. The connection to the challenge theme is not really evident to me though. Having said that I do like the model''s pose and expression. The style of the image makes the model look a little bit alien in the environment which I think adds to the impact.', '2004-12-19 02:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068659, 128311, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the atmosphere generated by this image. Its got a Gothic or Victorian era type feel. Off the top of my head it brings up memories of stories like "Wuthering Heights" or "Jane Eyre." The composition, noise and slight blur all add to the atmosphere of the image. Also the conversion to black and white has been beautifully done. Good Luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I love the atmosphere generated by this image. Its got a Gothic or Victorian era type feel. Off the top of my head it brings up memories of stories like "Wuthering Heights" or "Jane Eyre." The composition, noise and slight blur all add to the atmosphere of the image. Also the conversion to black and white has been beautifully done. Good Luck with the challenge.', '2004-12-19 02:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068665, 127620, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is one of the more subtle interpretations of the theme. Its a beautiful image. The colouring and lighting enhance the mood of the scene. This image would not look out of place on the wall of an Italian restaurant. Good Luck.</td>', 'This is one of the more subtle interpretations of the theme. Its a beautiful image. The colouring and lighting enhance the mood of the scene. This image would not look out of place on the wall of an Italian restaurant. Good Luck.', '2004-12-19 03:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068670, 128147, 20056, '<td valign="top">Very nice hue, it works for me!<br/>but I do not feel wind here :) a 7</td>', 'Very nice hue, it works for me!but I do not feel wind here :) a 7', '2004-12-19 03:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068672, 128444, 23300, '<td valign="top">I believe that this is the best of the flag images from this challenge. (I haven''t seen any other flag apart from the USA so far). The title and the overbearing nature of the composition create a dramatic impact. Its not hard to imagine this on the cover of an edition of "TIME" magazine or something similar.</td>', 'I believe that this is the best of the flag images from this challenge. (I haven''t seen any other flag apart from the USA so far). The title and the overbearing nature of the composition create a dramatic impact. Its not hard to imagine this on the cover of an edition of "TIME" magazine or something similar.', '2004-12-19 03:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1068679, 128196, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. One of the most dramatic uses of depth of field I''ve ever seen. The composition really enhances the subject matter and the colours are very dramatic also. The more I look at it the more it intrigues me. It goes beyond words. Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful image. One of the most dramatic uses of depth of field I''ve ever seen. The composition really enhances the subject matter and the colours are very dramatic also. The more I look at it the more it intrigues me. It goes beyond words. Beautiful.', '2004-12-19 03:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
