(1069198, 127510, 27605, '<td valign="top">I think this shot lacks only one thing - a focal point (such as a surfer or swimmers).  The blowing spray does a good job of depicting WIND.</td>', 'I think this shot lacks only one thing - a focal point (such as a surfer or swimmers).  The blowing spray does a good job of depicting WIND.', '2004-12-19 19:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069213, 128293, 15497, '<td valign="top">Impressive wind here, and nice silluett effect on the builds. I would probably have removed the glare from the sun. It also looks a tad oversharpened on the buildings. Anyhow, as regards to the challenge, you''re head on. And deserve extra credit for really capturing what this is all about. Wind. 8 Good luck</td>', 'Impressive wind here, and nice silluett effect on the builds. I would probably have removed the glare from the sun. It also looks a tad oversharpened on the buildings. Anyhow, as regards to the challenge, you''re head on. And deserve extra credit for really capturing what this is all about. Wind. 8 Good luck', '2004-12-19 19:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069216, 128143, 15497, '<td valign="top">Pro: Lovely kid, clearly meet challenge, interesting angle<br/>Cons: Too little contrast, too much shadows on his face, could be sharper.<br/> <br/>Overall a 5 image, but this kid is too cute for a 5 bumping up to 6 :-) GL</td>', 'Pro: Lovely kid, clearly meet challenge, interesting angleCons: Too little contrast, too much shadows on his face, could be sharper. Overall a 5 image, but this kid is too cute for a 5 bumping up to 6 :-) GL', '2004-12-19 19:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069218, 127361, 15497, '<td valign="top">*laugh* As a standalone image, this is very well done. I love your zoom-effect, and if it was a open free study I''d give you an 8 for the warm feeling I get from this image. BUT, this is a Wind challenge, and all I see is a lens effect, It looks like you''re zooming to achive the effect of win. And you don''t succed :-\<br/> <br/>I''m giving you a 5, which is 1 more then I wanna give, but it''s because I actually like the image. But being off-topic should be penalized even more. GL though!</td>', '*laugh* As a standalone image, this is very well done. I love your zoom-effect, and if it was a open free study I''d give you an 8 for the warm feeling I get from this image. BUT, this is a Wind challenge, and all I see is a lens effect, It looks like you''re zooming to achive the effect of win. And you don''t succed :-\ I''m giving you a 5, which is 1 more then I wanna give, but it''s because I actually like the image. But being off-topic should be penalized even more. GL though!', '2004-12-19 19:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069219, 127490, 15497, '<td valign="top">A nice haircut. But wind? I still like the effect, but I''m not sure it''s due to wind or just the hair. 5</td>', 'A nice haircut. But wind? I still like the effect, but I''m not sure it''s due to wind or just the hair. 5', '2004-12-19 19:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069220, 128473, 15497, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop, and nice concept of wind. You got my support. But next time try to capture some more lines into it, make it more interesting. 6</td>', 'Interesting crop, and nice concept of wind. You got my support. But next time try to capture some more lines into it, make it more interesting. 6', '2004-12-19 19:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
