(1069917, 127743, 25952, '<td valign="top">hm  i think this is good composition. It seems a bit noisy/pixellated though, which makes me wonder if you cropped a small portion of a much larger photo, which is fine, but it just loses clarity. Im sure this might be a hard shot to capture but getting closer might really do wonders for it. I''m a fan of negative space when well used, so despite the quality i''ll give it a 7</td>', 'hm  i think this is good composition. It seems a bit noisy/pixellated though, which makes me wonder if you cropped a small portion of a much larger photo, which is fine, but it just loses clarity. Im sure this might be a hard shot to capture but getting closer might really do wonders for it. I''m a fan of negative space when well used, so despite the quality i''ll give it a 7', '2004-12-20 03:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1069918, 127786, 25952, '<td valign="top">i''m no good at studio shots, but this seems flat to me. If i knew much about lights id give more specific suggestions than this- but it seems you need them, and perhaps a less textured and softer backdrop.</td>', 'i''m no good at studio shots, but this seems flat to me. If i knew much about lights id give more specific suggestions than this- but it seems you need them, and perhaps a less textured and softer backdrop.', '2004-12-20 03:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
