(1070047, 128439, 9668, '<td valign="top">Ecclesiastes 1:17 (NIV):<br/>"Then I applied myself to the understanding of wisdom, and also of madness and folly, but I learned that this, too, is a chasing after the wind."<br/> <br/>Chasing after wisdom is fruitful, chasing after wind is not.<br/> <br/>I can see that the person is throwing a pager or a book out, but it is so dark that it is hard to tell what is happening. The white dot, mid chest, confuses me. Focus all seems a little blurry. <br/> <br/>Hope that you understand that I''m not trying to be harsh to your photo, just trying to help you take better ones in the future. 3</td>', 'Ecclesiastes 1:17 (NIV):"Then I applied myself to the understanding of wisdom, and also of madness and folly, but I learned that this, too, is a chasing after the wind." Chasing after wisdom is fruitful, chasing after wind is not. I can see that the person is throwing a pager or a book out, but it is so dark that it is hard to tell what is happening. The white dot, mid chest, confuses me. Focus all seems a little blurry.  Hope that you understand that I''m not trying to be harsh to your photo, just trying to help you take better ones in the future. 3', '2004-12-20 05:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
