(1070049, 128232, 9668, '<td valign="top">Does show the wind, but the composition is a little confusing. The stairwell on the left detracts the eye, the window below and balcony above a little as well. Also seems a tad overexposed. I like how you''ve placed the kites in the rule of thirds though.</td>', 'Does show the wind, but the composition is a little confusing. The stairwell on the left detracts the eye, the window below and balcony above a little as well. Also seems a tad overexposed. I like how you''ve placed the kites in the rule of thirds though.', '2004-12-20 05:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
