(1070493, 128416, 30861, '<td valign="top">Like too many other images in this challenge, this is one is static where I expect to see energy, especially in an image TITLED "Energy"... I can see why you have chosen your POV, from an overall compositional perspective, but given that this photo is "of" the windmills, surely we''d be better served by an angle that exposes more of the blades to our view?</td>', 'Like too many other images in this challenge, this is one is static where I expect to see energy, especially in an image TITLED "Energy"... I can see why you have chosen your POV, from an overall compositional perspective, but given that this photo is "of" the windmills, surely we''d be better served by an angle that exposes more of the blades to our view?', '2004-12-20 11:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1070495, 128115, 30861, '<td valign="top">nice &amp; simple</td>', 'nice & simple', '2004-12-20 11:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
