(1071742, 126916, 12253, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, perfet for wind, but much too noisy in the sky it''s distracting.  Also, you might have tried avoiding placing the focal point (the blowing snow), so close to vertical center.  You could have cropped a lot of the noisy sky and placed the snow on the upp er third line.  Or cropped some of the land below and gone for dramatic impact by using negative space (but then you would need to run neatimage or equivalent to eliminate the noise).</td>', 'Neat shot, perfet for wind, but much too noisy in the sky it''s distracting.  Also, you might have tried avoiding placing the focal point (the blowing snow), so close to vertical center.  You could have cropped a lot of the noisy sky and placed the snow on the upp er third line.  Or cropped some of the land below and gone for dramatic impact by using negative space (but then you would need to run neatimage or equivalent to eliminate the noise).', '2004-12-21 08:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
