(1071751, 127743, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea, great background (except it provides little contrast against the seedlings).  I think you needed a bit higher shutter speed though, or else resolution or a focus issue is making this too soft.</td>', 'Good idea, great background (except it provides little contrast against the seedlings).  I think you needed a bit higher shutter speed though, or else resolution or a focus issue is making this too soft.', '2004-12-21 08:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071752, 128398, 12654, '<td valign="top">Very stylish - and I love the border.</td>', 'Very stylish - and I love the border.', '2004-12-21 08:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071754, 128147, 12654, '<td valign="top">Amazing psychedelic colours.</td>', 'Amazing psychedelic colours.', '2004-12-21 08:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071755, 127967, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea; I think you should have cropped the building on the left mostly, putting the pole almost at the edge and the sock in the left third.</td>', 'Nice idea; I think you should have cropped the building on the left mostly, putting the pole almost at the edge and the sock in the left third.', '2004-12-21 08:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071756, 127397, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic sky and light, a bit surreal with the markers.  I think a zoom to the sock against the sky might have improved this--for Wind, the subject is too much a part of the background rather than a focal point.  The markers seem to be the focal point here.</td>', 'Nice dramatic sky and light, a bit surreal with the markers.  I think a zoom to the sock against the sky might have improved this--for Wind, the subject is too much a part of the background rather than a focal point.  The markers seem to be the focal point here.', '2004-12-21 09:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071757, 127962, 12253, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Seems a bit unclear though, perhaps because of flat light and low contrast and focus sharpness.</td>', 'Funny!  Seems a bit unclear though, perhaps because of flat light and low contrast and focus sharpness.', '2004-12-21 09:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071759, 127930, 12253, '<td valign="top">The rays are cool, but the flare is distracting from the real subject--wind.  Especially where the flare is very purple by the snow.</td>', 'The rays are cool, but the flare is distracting from the real subject--wind.  Especially where the flare is very purple by the snow.', '2004-12-21 09:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071760, 128461, 12654, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2004-12-21 09:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071761, 127052, 12654, '<td valign="top">this is a great photograph - but you could have named it "A bird" or sumin ;)</td>', 'this is a great photograph - but you could have named it "A bird" or sumin ;)', '2004-12-21 09:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071763, 128174, 12253, '<td valign="top">Clever, and very well done.  I think the point would be better made in landscape composition, but I like this as is too.</td>', 'Clever, and very well done.  I think the point would be better made in landscape composition, but I like this as is too.', '2004-12-21 09:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071767, 127546, 12253, '<td valign="top">This has great elements and the potential to be a winner.  However, the light is very flat, and the crop is too tight on the right.  That may have been necessary per the "trick" but it does take away a bit.  I am presuming this is a fake setup and is rotated 90 degrees, but I guess it''s plausable that the lighter kid could be "lifted" by the wind and the umbrella.  Oddly, the tilt of the plant perhaps looks the most fake part of the scene.  Stiill, good work!</td>', 'This has great elements and the potential to be a winner.  However, the light is very flat, and the crop is too tight on the right.  That may have been necessary per the "trick" but it does take away a bit.  I am presuming this is a fake setup and is rotated 90 degrees, but I guess it''s plausable that the lighter kid could be "lifted" by the wind and the umbrella.  Oddly, the tilt of the plant perhaps looks the most fake part of the scene.  Stiill, good work!', '2004-12-21 09:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071769, 128244, 12253, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky and tones!</td>', 'Gorgeous sky and tones!', '2004-12-21 09:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071801, 128489, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great compostion and entry.  This captures the power of wind with conviction from the kite, the dusting of sand around his feet and the surf in the back.  converting to a B&amp;W (or via desaturation) helps strengthen this image...8</td>', 'Great compostion and entry.  This captures the power of wind with conviction from the kite, the dusting of sand around his feet and the surf in the back.  converting to a B&W (or via desaturation) helps strengthen this image...8', '2004-12-21 09:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071803, 127053, 29477, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully captured image...8</td>', 'Wonderfully captured image...8', '2004-12-21 09:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071810, 128398, 29477, '<td valign="top">Definately the smartest composition of the conest (wink)...I much prefer your lighting and shadows to my version, however I think my model is way cuter.  If I could have set up my lighting to cast the shadow, our images would have been identical, however a decided to crop it.  Nicely done...7</td>', 'Definately the smartest composition of the conest (wink)...I much prefer your lighting and shadows to my version, however I think my model is way cuter.  If I could have set up my lighting to cast the shadow, our images would have been identical, however a decided to crop it.  Nicely done...7', '2004-12-21 09:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071812, 127003, 29477, '<td valign="top">Fantastice image and DOF.   Nicely composed with the casual people in the background enjoying a calm day and this poor gentlemen struggling to get to his destination...9</td>', 'Fantastice image and DOF.   Nicely composed with the casual people in the background enjoying a calm day and this poor gentlemen struggling to get to his destination...9', '2004-12-21 09:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071814, 127921, 29477, '<td valign="top">The best sailing entry in my view.  The partial silhoutte created by the natural light is fantastic...good job.</td>', 'The best sailing entry in my view.  The partial silhoutte created by the natural light is fantastic...good job.', '2004-12-21 09:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071839, 127490, 16901, '<td valign="top">I love this image. The wind blown hair and especialy the expression on the child''s face. Her expression implies something of the un-known about the wind. What is it ? Where does it come from ? Where is it going ?</td>', 'I love this image. The wind blown hair and especialy the expression on the child''s face. Her expression implies something of the un-known about the wind. What is it ? Where does it come from ? Where is it going ?', '2004-12-21 10:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071841, 128491, 17505, '<td valign="top">I love the way the top of the grass and  the clouds blur into each other. Beautiful capture.</td>', 'I love the way the top of the grass and  the clouds blur into each other. Beautiful capture.', '2004-12-21 10:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071842, 128076, 16901, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this image and the "tongue - in - cheek" twist on the theme.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this image and the "tongue - in - cheek" twist on the theme.', '2004-12-21 10:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071845, 128037, 17505, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and texture. Very impressive.</td>', 'Excellent colors and texture. Very impressive.', '2004-12-21 10:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071847, 128244, 16901, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I love the composition, colors and the sculpted look of the clouds.</td>', 'Beautiful image. I love the composition, colors and the sculpted look of the clouds.', '2004-12-21 10:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071860, 128410, 17505, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous detail and lovely colors. The backgound is a bit distracting, perhaps shot from a lower angle would have gotten rid of the stuff along the bottom..</td>', 'Gorgeous detail and lovely colors. The backgound is a bit distracting, perhaps shot from a lower angle would have gotten rid of the stuff along the bottom..', '2004-12-21 10:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071861, 128451, 16901, '<td valign="top">Great creative effort on this.</td>', 'Great creative effort on this.', '2004-12-21 10:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071880, 128215, 30712, '<td valign="top">Like the idea and the framing of the trees.  The telephone cables let the image down a little.</td>', 'Like the idea and the framing of the trees.  The telephone cables let the image down a little.', '2004-12-21 10:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071881, 128485, 28337, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but i don''t get it :(</td>', 'nice picture, but i don''t get it :(', '2004-12-21 10:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071882, 128250, 30712, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more evidence of the wind to make the image match the subject.  The flag does this I know but it is a very small part of the picture.  Very atmospheric.</td>', 'I''d like to see more evidence of the wind to make the image match the subject.  The flag does this I know but it is a very small part of the picture.  Very atmospheric.', '2004-12-21 10:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071885, 127886, 30712, '<td valign="top">The water is covered in ripples and it''s a joy to look at but it still doesn''t shout wind to me.  I like the way the eye is carried through the picture to the top left hand corner and under the bridge.</td>', 'The water is covered in ripples and it''s a joy to look at but it still doesn''t shout wind to me.  I like the way the eye is carried through the picture to the top left hand corner and under the bridge.', '2004-12-21 10:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071887, 128176, 30712, '<td valign="top">Great idea but I do find the scene rather gloomy and in need of a lift.  Perhaps some flash would have brightened the flag and added some life to the foreground.</td>', 'Great idea but I do find the scene rather gloomy and in need of a lift.  Perhaps some flash would have brightened the flag and added some life to the foreground.', '2004-12-21 10:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071892, 128435, 30712, '<td valign="top">Great sea and sky.  I''d like to have moved the camera round to the left a bit and homed in on the dramatic waves a bit more.</td>', 'Great sea and sky.  I''d like to have moved the camera round to the left a bit and homed in on the dramatic waves a bit more.', '2004-12-21 11:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071893, 128047, 30712, '<td valign="top">Very clever vertical shot which gains a lot from its simplicity.</td>', 'Very clever vertical shot which gains a lot from its simplicity.', '2004-12-21 11:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071895, 128147, 30712, '<td valign="top">I think this is a clever use of camera angle to trick the eye.</td>', 'I think this is a clever use of camera angle to trick the eye.', '2004-12-21 11:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071896, 127620, 30712, '<td valign="top">The area surrounding the candle really gives a feeling of mystery and gloom.  Lovely idea.</td>', 'The area surrounding the candle really gives a feeling of mystery and gloom.  Lovely idea.', '2004-12-21 11:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071898, 128491, 30712, '<td valign="top">A simple three shot made up from three main areas - sky, grass and sand.  Simple and appealing.</td>', 'A simple three shot made up from three main areas - sky, grass and sand.  Simple and appealing.', '2004-12-21 11:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071900, 126980, 30712, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait but not quite windy enough for the wind to make a statement.</td>', 'Nice portrait but not quite windy enough for the wind to make a statement.', '2004-12-21 11:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071901, 128415, 30712, '<td valign="top">Perhaps I''m missing something here but this scene doesn''t seem to say wind to me.  An interesting night shot.</td>', 'Perhaps I''m missing something here but this scene doesn''t seem to say wind to me.  An interesting night shot.', '2004-12-21 11:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071903, 128430, 30712, '<td valign="top">Very much an after the wind image.  The leaves that are left make a good contrast against  the sky.</td>', 'Very much an after the wind image.  The leaves that are left make a good contrast against  the sky.', '2004-12-21 11:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071904, 127684, 30712, '<td valign="top">Superb!  What a great idea.</td>', 'Superb!  What a great idea.', '2004-12-21 11:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071906, 127807, 30712, '<td valign="top">An interesting use of shape and colour.</td>', 'An interesting use of shape and colour.', '2004-12-21 11:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071907, 128493, 30712, '<td valign="top">What a great model.  The idea is lovely as is the completed image.</td>', 'What a great model.  The idea is lovely as is the completed image.', '2004-12-21 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071910, 127911, 30712, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2004-12-21 11:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071913, 128447, 30712, '<td valign="top">A bold approach to the theme and it works well.</td>', 'A bold approach to the theme and it works well.', '2004-12-21 11:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071915, 128244, 27342, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!</td>', 'This is a great shot!', '2004-12-21 11:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071916, 128311, 30712, '<td valign="top">Works well in monochrome.  I love the smooth gradation of tones.</td>', 'Works well in monochrome.  I love the smooth gradation of tones.', '2004-12-21 11:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071917, 128114, 30712, '<td valign="top">The long format works well.</td>', 'The long format works well.', '2004-12-21 11:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071920, 127663, 30712, '<td valign="top">The brightening of the image from bottom to top lifts the eye to the main feature.  Excellent</td>', 'The brightening of the image from bottom to top lifts the eye to the main feature.  Excellent', '2004-12-21 11:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1071921, 127003, 30712, '<td valign="top">Works well as a comic photo.</td>', 'Works well as a comic photo.', '2004-12-21 11:16:46.000000', NULL, 1);
