(1071944, 127986, 30712, '<td valign="top">An after the wind scene.  I lke the dark corners that emphasize the flash of colour through the centre.</td>', 'An after the wind scene.  I lke the dark corners that emphasize the flash of colour through the centre.', '2004-12-21 11:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
