(1071963, 127763, 30712, '<td valign="top">Super composition.  Now why weren''t the sails on the move.  I know - we can''t have it all.</td>', 'Super composition.  Now why weren''t the sails on the move.  I know - we can''t have it all.', '2004-12-21 11:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
