(1072025, 128493, 29148, '<td valign="top">I had that exact idea, but did not shoot it since I don''t let my German Shepherd in my car. Nice shot, and spaniel. 7</td>', 'I had that exact idea, but did not shoot it since I don''t let my German Shepherd in my car. Nice shot, and spaniel. 7', '2004-12-21 12:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
