(1072634, 128161, 18644, '<td valign="top">Great subject, i''m simply in love with these. I do believe I would have kept the picture straight. But it''s my point of view, not yours. 7</td>', 'Great subject, i''m simply in love with these. I do believe I would have kept the picture straight. But it''s my point of view, not yours. 7', '2004-12-21 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
