(1072636, 128215, 30980, '<td valign="top">A good show of movement, although the photo is overexposed in the sky areas. This could have been solved easily by using a combination of the following: slower shutter speed, smaller aperture (f8.0), and the use of flash to light the bird, and exposure set to include the sky and trees.</td>', 'A good show of movement, although the photo is overexposed in the sky areas. This could have been solved easily by using a combination of the following: slower shutter speed, smaller aperture (f8.0), and the use of flash to light the bird, and exposure set to include the sky and trees.', '2004-12-21 20:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1072641, 127983, 30980, '<td valign="top">While this is a good photo, there is not enough showing of wind. The stalks in the foreground appear to be vertical while some in the background or midground are slightly leaning to the left.</td>', 'While this is a good photo, there is not enough showing of wind. The stalks in the foreground appear to be vertical while some in the background or midground are slightly leaning to the left.', '2004-12-21 20:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
