(1073136, 128493, 19810, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone, and the top 20 finish.  This is a shot I''ve been waiting to do for quite a while - and then finally the "Wind" challenge blew (pun intended) into town!  To answer a few of the questions that had been posted --<br/> <br/>1) This is my dog Chazz, a buff male Cocker Spaniel ... age approximately 6 years old (he is adopted and exact birth records are unknown).<br/> <br/>2) No, I wasn''t driving.  Much thanks to my girlfriend for driving so that I could hang my body out the window to get this shot.<br/> <br/>3) The sky.  Yes, this was my biggest disappointment in this shot.  It had been raining for days prior to this shot, and I finally got one say with mostly cloudy skies but no rain.  I was hoping to get a good expression *and* a touch of blue sky in the background - but it just wasn''t meant to be.  Of course, after the challenge window ended, nothing but blue skies.....<br/> <br/>Again, thanks for all the votes and comments!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone, and the top 20 finish.  This is a shot I''ve been waiting to do for quite a while - and then finally the "Wind" challenge blew (pun intended) into town!  To answer a few of the questions that had been posted -- 1) This is my dog Chazz, a buff male Cocker Spaniel ... age approximately 6 years old (he is adopted and exact birth records are unknown). 2) No, I wasn''t driving.  Much thanks to my girlfriend for driving so that I could hang my body out the window to get this shot. 3) The sky.  Yes, this was my biggest disappointment in this shot.  It had been raining for days prior to this shot, and I finally got one say with mostly cloudy skies but no rain.  I was hoping to get a good expression *and* a touch of blue sky in the background - but it just wasn''t meant to be.  Of course, after the challenge window ended, nothing but blue skies..... Again, thanks for all the votes and comments! ', '2004-12-22 00:48:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1073138, 127546, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congrats.  I knew this would ribbon!  Well done.</td>', 'Congrats.  I knew this would ribbon!  Well done.', '2004-12-22 00:48:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1073139, 128244, 7291, '<td valign="top">BTW, if anyone is interested I''d be happy to post more shots from this sunset.  I think this was the best one but they are all pretty amazing.</td>', 'BTW, if anyone is interested I''d be happy to post more shots from this sunset.  I think this was the best one but they are all pretty amazing.', '2004-12-22 00:49:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1073144, 128244, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wow! Congrats on a very well deserved blue, and the 5th highest-rated photo ever for the Digital Rebel (144th overall, I think). Now get a high-res version uploaded to DPCPrints <i>pronto</i> and tell Mike Daniels where to find them!</td>', 'Wow! Congrats on a very well deserved blue, and the 5th highest-rated photo ever for the Digital Rebel (144th overall, I think). Now get a high-res version uploaded to DPCPrints pronto and tell Mike Daniels where to find them!', '2004-12-22 00:50:32.000000', NULL, 0),
