(1073157, 128076, 29069, '<td valign="top"><br/>thanks for all the comments!<br/> <br/>As evidenced by some of the comments, I don''t think everybody "got" what i was trying to do here. Anyway, it was a fun submission for me.<br/> <br/>I had intended the orangey color cast as Im used to CRs having lighted by incandescent bulbs. I did shoot a white-balanced version, but it did not feel natural to me. Oh well, might have colored it too orangey...and in challenges, you have to please people, not yourself.<br/> <br/>Again thanks!<br/> <br/></td>', 'thanks for all the comments! As evidenced by some of the comments, I don''t think everybody "got" what i was trying to do here. Anyway, it was a fun submission for me. I had intended the orangey color cast as Im used to CRs having lighted by incandescent bulbs. I did shoot a white-balanced version, but it did not feel natural to me. Oh well, might have colored it too orangey...and in challenges, you have to please people, not yourself. Again thanks! ', '2004-12-22 00:56:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1073191, 128480, 12896, '<td valign="top">Thats just great!</td>', 'Thats just great!', '2004-12-22 01:05:30.000000', NULL, 0),
