(1074689, 128398, 1368, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gloda:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gloda:</b></div><hr/><i>Now that I''ve seen the other pics, I can say that I will eat a broomstick if you don''t get the blue ribbon. Good luck. </i></td></tr></table> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//webplaza.pt.lu/fernglod/fun/broom.jpg'', strrpos(''//webplaza.pt.lu/fernglod/fun/broom.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//webplaza.pt.lu/fernglod/fun/broom.jpg"/> <br/>Voters can be so cruel... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hope it tasted as good as it looks ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by gloda: Originally posted by gloda:Now that I''ve seen the other pics, I can say that I will eat a broomstick if you don''t get the blue ribbon. Good luck.   Voters can be so cruel...  Hope it tasted as good as it looks ;)', '2004-12-22 19:46:04.000000', NULL, 0),
