(1075173, 128466, 23141, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by goodman:</b></div><hr/><i> no no no, this should have been much higher!<br/>great image! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>  Thanks for your vote and your praise :)  I''m not upset - I wasn''t sure this picture would do all that well on account of several factors, but we did have fun taking it.  I think that if I had included a bit of an old-time fan on the right side, it would have done better.<br/>  It wasn''t exactly what I wanted, but I''ve also had a good time post-processing several shots from this shoot for framing and greeting cards (even have her singing into a microphone in one!)<br/>  Thanks again!<br/>              -Kim</td>', 'Originally posted by goodman: no no no, this should have been much higher!great image!     Thanks for your vote and your praise :)  I''m not upset - I wasn''t sure this picture would do all that well on account of several factors, but we did have fun taking it.  I think that if I had included a bit of an old-time fan on the right side, it would have done better.  It wasn''t exactly what I wanted, but I''ve also had a good time post-processing several shots from this shoot for framing and greeting cards (even have her singing into a microphone in one!)  Thanks again!              -Kim', '2004-12-23 09:31:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1075191, 127510, 12611, '<td valign="top">At first I was thinking to myself that this was a candy shot and had very little artistic value- but then- I was really taken by the green color of the waves and you could almost taste the sea spray. fantastic color and great job!</td>', 'At first I was thinking to myself that this was a candy shot and had very little artistic value- but then- I was really taken by the green color of the waves and you could almost taste the sea spray. fantastic color and great job!', '2004-12-23 10:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1076133, 128391, 26827, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone, for your comments.  In response:  yes, I did "plan" this, but, in the 20-MPH winds I was shooting in, catching a shot of this flying piece of newspaper was tough :).  Ergo, composition was kind-of far from my mind.  I did base this on the idea from American Beauty, though it''s been a while since I saw tha tmovie.  I guess, from the responses, I was close enough.  I am curious as to what you think would have made a better background? (those of you who commented on that).  I have to say I am pretty pleased with the result.  My first entry with a DLSR, my highest rating (by a lot), and a top 25 finish, Woo!  Again, thanks for the comments.</td>', 'Thanks everyone, for your comments.  In response:  yes, I did "plan" this, but, in the 20-MPH winds I was shooting in, catching a shot of this flying piece of newspaper was tough :).  Ergo, composition was kind-of far from my mind.  I did base this on the idea from American Beauty, though it''s been a while since I saw tha tmovie.  I guess, from the responses, I was close enough.  I am curious as to what you think would have made a better background? (those of you who commented on that).  I have to say I am pretty pleased with the result.  My first entry with a DLSR, my highest rating (by a lot), and a top 25 finish, Woo!  Again, thanks for the comments.', '2004-12-24 02:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
