(1076457, 126980, 8759, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white. I do like the soft focus that adds a certain mood to the picture. The model expression is great, very thoughtful or sad or just melancholic. IMO this great expression got you lower votes during the challenge. It is that strong that the wind is only smth minor. Maybe a tighter crop on the hair would have emphasized the Wind...<br/>Edit to add that I somehow agree with purna''s comment<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-24 12:26:27.</i></td>', 'Nice use of black and white. I do like the soft focus that adds a certain mood to the picture. The model expression is great, very thoughtful or sad or just melancholic. IMO this great expression got you lower votes during the challenge. It is that strong that the wind is only smth minor. Maybe a tighter crop on the hair would have emphasized the Wind...Edit to add that I somehow agree with purna''s comment', '2004-12-24 12:24:34.000000', '2004-12-24 12:26:27.000000', 0),
