(1078806, 128244, 29799, '<td valign="top">This shot is something else! Weird clouds... Can you say Close Encounters?  I think the cropping is great. It shows the blue skies behind the clouds and, as you said, the building gives you a perspective on how HUGE the spaceship cloud was!!! Well done and a great ribbon winner!</td>', 'This shot is something else! Weird clouds... Can you say Close Encounters?  I think the cropping is great. It shows the blue skies behind the clouds and, as you said, the building gives you a perspective on how HUGE the spaceship cloud was!!! Well done and a great ribbon winner!', '2004-12-27 11:44:41.000000', NULL, 0),
