(1082107, 128244, 7291, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jpochard:</b></div><hr/><i> My daughter just brought in some new stamps.   They''re from a series called "cloudscapes" and there''s one on there that looks a lot like yours1  I actually like yours much better.  See if this link works: <br/> <br/><a href="//shop.usps.com/images/altocumuluslenticularis.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Postal Service Stamp</a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the link and the compliment Judy.  It''svery much appreciated.</td>', 'Originally posted by jpochard: My daughter just brought in some new stamps.   They''re from a series called "cloudscapes" and there''s one on there that looks a lot like yours1  I actually like yours much better.  See if this link works:  Postal Service Stamp   Thanks for the link and the compliment Judy.  It''svery much appreciated.', '2004-12-29 18:01:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1082785, 128420, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice entry, max, sorry it didn''t finish higher.  it got a 7 from me.  i think you might have been voted down for over-processing.  while pleasing to some (i like it, neil liked it), most voters want the vivid colors to also include razor sharp photographic detail (for example check out the ebeneezer corkscrooged entry in hidden faces.  i know that will be a top 10, and wouldn''t be surprized if it doesn''t blue.)  all the same, keep shooting!  good luck!<br/> <br/>skip</td>', 'nice entry, max, sorry it didn''t finish higher.  it got a 7 from me.  i think you might have been voted down for over-processing.  while pleasing to some (i like it, neil liked it), most voters want the vivid colors to also include razor sharp photographic detail (for example check out the ebeneezer corkscrooged entry in hidden faces.  i know that will be a top 10, and wouldn''t be surprized if it doesn''t blue.)  all the same, keep shooting!  good luck! skip', '2004-12-30 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
