(1091362, 128420, 4411, '<td valign="top">This is great.<br/>True, ''overprocessed'' stuff never does well in the challenges, but I''m always glad to see the more experimental stuff. Just don''t enter it to get a high score : )<br/> <br/>The processing is cool and the composition is great (the lines and shapes of the candles especially). Keep it coming!</td>', 'This is great.True, ''overprocessed'' stuff never does well in the challenges, but I''m always glad to see the more experimental stuff. Just don''t enter it to get a high score : ) The processing is cool and the composition is great (the lines and shapes of the candles especially). Keep it coming!', '2005-01-04 20:50:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1107129, 128492, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice, sharp image with a strong composition.  the hand helps tell the story, and the bw works well.  what i like most is the diagonal balance between the tree and the sky, split by the umbrella and arm.  if you intended that, i would say "great job!"  if you got lucky, then know that is what makes the image, and that is the type of thing to keep your eye out for when shooting.  congrats on your top 30!</td>', 'nice, sharp image with a strong composition.  the hand helps tell the story, and the bw works well.  what i like most is the diagonal balance between the tree and the sky, split by the umbrella and arm.  if you intended that, i would say "great job!"  if you got lucky, then know that is what makes the image, and that is the type of thing to keep your eye out for when shooting.  congrats on your top 30!', '2005-01-14 06:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
